[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m If $\arccos x + \arccos 2x + \arccos 3x = \pi,$ then $x$ satisfies a cubic polynomial of the form
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d = 0,\]where $a,$ $b,$ $c,$ and $d$ are integers, and $a \neq 0.$  Find the smallest possible value of $|a| + |b| + |c| + |d|.$
