[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given the equation \( p(x)q(x) = q(x)p(x) + 16x^2 - 4x - 16 \), and knowing that \( p(x) \) is a constant polynomial, we can set \( p(x) = c \) where \( c \) is a constant. Then the equation becomes:
