[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the equation \(\sqrt{5x} \cdot \sqrt{10x} \cdot \sqrt{18x} = 30\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Combine the square roots on the left-hand side:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{5x} \cdot \sqrt{10x} \cdot \sqrt{18x} = \sqrt{5x \cdot 10x \cdot 18x}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Simplify inside the square root:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    5x \cdot 10x \cdot 18x = 5 \cdot 10 \cdot 18 \cdot x^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the product inside the square root:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    5 \cdot 10 \cdot 18 = 5 \cdot 10 \cdot 18 = 900
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    5x \cdot 10x \cdot 18x = 900x^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Rewrite the equation using the simplified expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{900x^3} = 30
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Simplify the square root of \(900x^3\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{900x^3} = \sqrt{900} \cdot \sqrt{x^3} = 30\sqrt{x^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Set the equation equal to 30:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    30\sqrt{x^3} = 30
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 7. **Solve for \(\sqrt{x^3}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{x^3} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 8. **Square both sides to solve for \(x\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x^3 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 9. **Take the cube root of both sides:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
