[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the total number of farthings, farthings, shillings, and pounds equivalent to 1 pound and 5 pence, we need to convert pound and 5 pence into the respective units using the given conversion factors:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 \text{ pound} &= 20 \text{ shillings}, \\
