[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 pound \(\times\) 20 shillings \(\times\) 1 farthing \(\times\) 1 farthing = 20 farthings
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we need to find out how many farthings are equivalent to 5 pence.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
