[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute the sum \(\frac{1}{5} + \frac{2}{5} + \frac{3}{5} + \dots + \frac{9}{5} + \frac{10}{5}\), we can observe that this is a series of \(\frac{1}{5}\) divided by the last number in the series.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The series starts as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1}{5} + \frac{2}{5} + \frac{3}{5} + \dots + \frac{9}{5} + \frac{10}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This is the same as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1}{5} + \frac{1+2}{5} + \frac{1+2+3}{5} + \dots + \frac{1+2+3+\dots+9}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Each term in the series is effectively one fifth of the difference between the two preceding terms. Specifically, the second term is \(\frac{(1+2)}{5}\), the third term is \(\frac{(1+2+3)}{5}\), and so on until the last term is \(\frac{1+2+3+4+5+6+7+8+9}{5} = \frac{45}{5} = 9\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the series can be written as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sum_{n=1}^{9} \left( \frac{1+2+3+\dots+(2n-1)}{5} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The sum of the first \(n\) natural numbers is given by the formula \(\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\). Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sum_{n=1}^{9} \left( \frac{45}{5} \right) = \sum_{n=1}^{9} 9 = 9 \times 9 = 81
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the sum is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
