[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Total Number of Meals**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    To find the total number of different meals Tyler can choose, we multiply the number of meat choices by the number of vegetable and dessert choices.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
