[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Calculate the total calories burned per week:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Each minute of shooting hoops burns 150 calories.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - There are 210 minutes in one week.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
