[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, Kendra would burn \boxed{31500} calories shooting hoops if she shot hoops 30 minutes every day for one week.<|endoftext|>
