[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2y + 6 = 7a \quad \text{(Equation 6)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From Equation 3, solve for \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 12 - 3y = 2a
