[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m y = \frac{12 - 2a}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now substitute \(y = \frac{12 - 2a}{3}\) back into Equation 6:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
