[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In the diagram, $ABCD$ is a square with side length $6,$ and $WXYZ$ is a rectangle with $ZY=10$ and $XY=6.$ Also, $AD$ and $WX$ are perpendicular. If the shaded area is equal to half of the area of $WXYZ,$ what is the length of $AP?$
