[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m How many of the natural numbers from $1$ to $800,$ inclusive, contain the digit $6$ at least twice? (The numbers $266$ and $663$ are two natural numbers that contain the digit $6$ at least twice, but $430$ or $16$ are not.)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
