[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The complex numbers $a$ and $b$ satisfy
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[a + \overline{b} = 2 - 7i.\]Find $\overline{a} + b.$
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
