[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We do this by repeatedly dividing the number by 8 and recording the remainders.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 8888 \div 8 = 1101 \text{ remainder } 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1101 \div 8 = 137 \text{ remainder } 7
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 137 \div 8 = 17 \text{ remainder } 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
