[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get the base-8 representation of \(8888_{10}\) as \(21370_{8}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we need to find the sum of the digits of \(21370_{8}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
