[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the sum of the digits of the base-8 expression for \(8888_{10}\) is \(\boxed{13}\).<|endoftext|>
