[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the ratio of the area of triangle $BDC$ to the area of triangle $ADC$? Express your answer as a common fraction.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m draw((0,0)--(10sqrt(3),0)--(0,10)--(0,0)--cycle,linewidth(2));
