[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Evaluate $i^{11} + i^{111}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To evaluate \(i^{11} + i^{111}\), we need to understand the powers of the imaginary unit \(i\). The powers of \(i\) cycle every four terms as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^1 &= i \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^2 &= -1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^3 &= -i \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^4 &= 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^5 &= i \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^6 &= -1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^7 &= -i \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^8 &= 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From this, we can see that the powers of \(i\) repeat every four terms. Therefore, for any integer \(n\), we can write \(n\) as \(4k + r\) where \(k\) is an integer and \(0 \leq r < 4\). Now, let's evaluate \(i^{11}\) and \(i^{111}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 11 = 4 \cdot 2 + 3 \implies i^{11} = i^3 = -i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Similarly,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 111 = 4 \cdot 27 + 3 \implies i^{111} = i^{27} = (i^4)^6 \cdot i^3 = 1^6 \cdot -i = -i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Adding these together, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i^{11} + i^{111} = -i + (-i) = -2i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{-2i}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
