[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we can find \( A + B \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
