[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Move to the ten-thousands place:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      1_6 + 1_6 = 2_6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Move to the hundred-thousands place:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
