[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Convert the base 6 number to a decimal number:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The base 6 number $0255_6$ can be converted to base 10 by multiplying each digit by the corresponding power of 6 and summing them up:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
