[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Divide 109 by 6:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      109 \div 6 = 18 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Divide 18 by 6:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      18 \div 6 = 3 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Divide 3 by 6:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      3 \div 6 = 0 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
