[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This is not correct, so we need to check our assumptions. Instead, let's solve the quadratic equation \(9a^2 + 9b^2 - 4a^2b^2 = 0\) for \(ab = 3\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can use the roots of the quadratic equation \(3x^2 - bc - 4ax - 2y = 0\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
