[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m By trial and error or solving the quadratic equation, we find that \(ab = 3\) when \(a = \sqrt{3}\) and \(b = \frac{3}{\sqrt{3}} = \sqrt{3}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
