[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the remainder when $x^4-7x^3+9x^2+16x-13$ is divided by $x-3$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the remainder when \( x^4 - 7x^3 + 9x^2 + 16x - 13 \) is divided by \( x - 3 \), we can use the Remainder Theorem. The Remainder Theorem states that the remainder of the division of a polynomial \( f(x) \) by \( x - c \) is \( f(c) \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In this case, we are dividing by \( x - 3 \), so we need to evaluate the polynomial at \( x = 3 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Substitute \( x = 3 \) into the polynomial \( f(x) = x^4 - 7x^3 + 9x^2 + 16x - 13 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(3) = 3^4 - 7 \cdot 3^3 + 9 \cdot 3^2 + 16 \cdot 3 - 13
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Calculate each term step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3^4 = 81
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -7 \cdot 3^3 = -7 \cdot 27 = -189
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 9 \cdot 3^2 = 9 \cdot 9 = 81
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 16 \cdot 3 = 48
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Substitute these values back into the expression for \( f(3) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(3) = 81 - 189 + 81 + 48 - 13
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Simplify the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 81 - 189 = -108
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -108 + 81 = -27
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -27 + 48 = 21
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 21 - 13 = 8
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the remainder when \( x^4 - 7x^3 + 9x^2 + 16x - 13 \) is divided by \( x - 3 \) is \(\boxed{8}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
