[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the remainder when the polynomial \( P(x) = x^4 - 7x^3 + 9x^2 + 16x - 13 \) is divided by \( x - 3 \), we can use the Remainder Theorem. The Remainder Theorem states that the remainder of the division of a polynomial \( P(x) \) by \( x - c \) is \( P(c) \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In this case, we are dividing by \( x - 3 \), so we need to find \( P(3) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ P(3) = 3^4 - 7 \cdot 3^3 + 9 \cdot 3^2 + 16 \cdot 3 - 13 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's calculate this step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Calculate \( 3^4 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 3^4 = 81 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Calculate \( 3^3 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 3^3 = 27 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Calculate \( 9 \cdot 3^2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 9 \cdot 27 = 243 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Calculate \( 16 \cdot 3 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 16 \cdot 3 = 48 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, plug these values back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ P(3) = 81 - 7 \cdot 27 + 243 + 48 - 13 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. Calculate \( 7 \cdot 27 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 7 \cdot 27 = 189 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. Substitute back into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ P(3) = 81 - 189 + 243 + 48 - 13 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 7. Simplify step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 81 - 189 = -108 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -108 + 243 = 135 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 135 + 48 = 183 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 183 - 13 = 170 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the remainder when \( x^4 - 7x^3 + 9x^2 + 16x - 13 \) is divided by \( x - 3 \) is \( \boxed{170} \).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
