[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Paula invests $\$10,\!000$ for 5 years at an interest rate of $10\%$ per year. If the interest is simple interest, how much is her investment worth at the end of those five years?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the value of Paula's investment at the end of five years with simple interest, we use the formula for simple interest:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ I = P \times r \times t \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m where:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( I \) is the interest,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( P \) is the principal amount (the initial amount of money),
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( r \) is the annual interest rate (in decimal form),
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( t \) is the time the money is invested for (in years).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( P = 10000 \) dollars,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( r = 0.10 \) (10% expressed as a decimal),
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( t = 5 \) years.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we calculate the interest \( I \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ I = 10000 \times 0.10 \times 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ I = 10000 \times 0.50 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ I = 5000 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The interest earned over five years is $5000. To find the total value of the investment at the end of five years, we add this interest to the principal amount:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ \text{Total value} = P + I \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ \text{Total value} = 10000 + 5000 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ \text{Total value} = 15000 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of Paula's investment at the end of five years is \(\boxed{15000}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \$15,\!000
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
