[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( x \) is a positive number, \( 2x \) is also a positive number. Therefore, the magnitude of \( x+10 \) minus \( 10-x \) is 2 \( x \).
