[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here are the steps we will follow:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Calculate the total cost of the car (vaccuming + the price of the car, which is 100 dollars and 90 minutes, converted to hours).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Calculate the total cost of the windows (cleaning + the cleaning cost, which is 180 dollars and 72 minutes, converted to hours).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Calculate the total cost of the beverages (12 ounces of the 12-ounce bottle of shampoo, 16 ounces of the 16-ounce bottle of coffee, the facial mask, and the 3/4 of a popsicle stick).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Determine the amount of the total oil bill premium offset, which is determined by the remainder of the income from the purchased beverages and subtracted from the total spending.
