[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the smallest positive integer \( n \) with the property that the polynomial \( x^4 - nx + 63 \) can be written as a product of two non-constant polynomials with integer coefficients is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
