[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We verified that \( P(x) = x^4 - 63x^2 + 63 \) is indeed the product of two quadratic polynomials with integer coefficients when \( n = 7 \).<|endoftext|>
