[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now we have a system of two equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \( S = G + 40 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \( S + G = 204 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can substitute the first equation into the second equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (G + 40) + G = 204
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
