[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m G = 82
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now that we know Greg's score, we can find Sarah's score using the first equation:
