[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need to find the sixth time Sarah achieved in seconds, and we know her median time had been reduced to 92 seconds after the sixth attempt. We also know the previous times for swimming 50 meters were 86, 94, 97, 88, and 96. Our current sixth attempt will be on the side at \(n=5\) location in the array of times. So, each subsequent guess will have us discounted the 5th order statistic off a 4th order statistic (whether it's the largest or 4th larget). Simply convert from an array of sorted numbers to an array of half sorted numbers,
