[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the ordered triple \((p, q, r)\), we start by expressing the given equation in matrix form. The equation \(\begin{pmatrix} -4 \\ 7 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix} = p \mathbf{a} + q \mathbf{b} + r \mathbf{c}\) can be written as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
