[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m p \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m q \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m r
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This gives us the following system of linear equations:
