[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m p + 2q + 4r = -4 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m p - 3q + r = 7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m p + q - 5r = 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can solve this system using any method, such as substitution or Gaussian elimination. Let's use the first three equations directly:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \(p + 2q + 4r = -4\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \(p - 3q + r = 7\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \(p + q - 5r = 3\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Subtract the second equation from the third equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (p + q - 5r) - (p - 3q + r) &= 3 - 7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m q + 4q - 6r &= -4 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5q - 6r &= -4.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now we have a new equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. \(5q - 6r = -4\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, subtract the first equation from this new equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
