[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute \(q = \frac{10r}{3}\) into the second original equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
