[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We now have \(p = \frac{-12 - 32r}{3}\) and \(q = \frac{10r}{3}\). To find \(r\), we substitute both \(p\) and \(q\) back into the third original equation:
