[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculate the product $\left(\frac{3}{6}\right)\left(\frac{6}{9}\right)\left(\frac{9}{12}\right)\cdots\left(\frac{2001}{2004}\right)$. Express your answer as a common fraction.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To calculate the product \(\left(\frac{3}{6}\right)\left(\frac{6}{9}\right)\left(\frac{9}{12}\right)\cdots\left(\frac{2001}{2004}\right)\), we start by examining the general form and looking for a cyclical pattern.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The general term in the product can be written as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{3k}{6(6-k)} \quad \text{for} \quad k = 1, 2, 3, \ldots, 2001
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's simplify the general term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{3k}{6(6-k)} = \frac{3k}{36 - 6k} = \frac{3}{6} \cdot \frac{k}{6 - k} = \frac{k}{2 - k}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the product becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left(\frac{3}{6}\right)\left(\frac{6}{9}\right)\left(\frac{9}{12}\right)\cdots\left(\frac{2001}{2004}\right) = \frac{1}{6} \cdot \frac{2}{5} \cdot \frac{3}{4} \cdots \frac{1001}{998}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Notice the telescoping nature of the product. Most terms will cancel out:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1}{6} \cdot \frac{2}{5} \cdot \frac{3}{4} \cdots \frac{1001}{998} = \frac{1001!}{6 \cdot 5 \cdot 4 \cdot 3 \cdot 2 \cdot 1 \cdot 999!} = \frac{1001}{6 \cdot 5 \cdot 4 \cdot 3 \cdot 2 \cdot 1}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1001}{6!5!4!3!2!1!} = \frac{1001}{720 \cdot 120 \cdot 120 \cdot 60 \cdot 20}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Further simplification:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 720 \cdot 120 \cdot 120 = 1296000
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 60 \cdot 20 = 1200
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1296000 \div 1200 = 110
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
