[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the missing digit in the five-digit number \(246\underline{\hspace{5pt}}8\) that makes it divisible by 9, we need to use the rule that a number is divisible by 9 if the sum of its digits is divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
