[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need \(20 + x\) to be divisible by 9. We can check the possible values of \(x\) from 0 to 9 to see which one satisfies this condition.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's test each value:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 0\), then the sum is \(20 + 0 = 20\), which is not divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 1\), then the sum is \(20 + 1 = 21\), which is not divisible by 9.
