[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 3\), then the sum is \(20 + 3 = 23\), which is not divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 4\), then the sum is \(20 + 4 = 24\), which is not divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 5\), then the sum is \(20 + 5 = 25\), which is not divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 6\), then the sum is \(20 + 6 = 26\), which is not divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 7\), then the sum is \(20 + 7 = 27\), which is divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 8\), then the sum is \(20 + 8 = 28\), which is not divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - If \(x = 9\), then the sum is \(20 + 9 = 29\), which is not divisible by 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The only value that makes \(20 + x\) divisible by 9 is \(x = 7\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
