[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \( x \), we add 15 to both sides of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
