[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we divide both sides by 2:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x = \frac{15}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
