[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute \( 7 \left(\frac{1}{5}\right)^3 \), we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Identify the base number and the exponent:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The base number is \( 7 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The exponent is \( 3 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The expression inside the parentheses is \( \frac{1}{5} \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Raise the base to the power of the exponent:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \left(\frac{1}{5}\right)^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Multiply the base by itself three times:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \left(\frac{1}{5}\right) \times \left(\frac{1}{5}\right) \times \left(\frac{1}{5}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Express multiplication of powers with the same base as multiplication of individual powers:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
