[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Simplify the fraction:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \frac{1}{125}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
