[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \(\mathbf{c} \times (3 \mathbf{a} - 2 \mathbf{b})\), we will use the distributive property of the cross product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{c} \times (3 \mathbf{a} - 2 \mathbf{b}) = \mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a} - \mathbf{c} \times 2 \mathbf{b}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's compute \(\mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3 \mathbf{a} = 3 \begin{pmatrix} a_1 \\ a_2 \\ a_3 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 3a_1 \\ 3a_2 \\ 3a_3 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, compute the cross product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} 3a_1 \\ 3a_2 \\ 3a_3 \end{pmatrix} \times \begin{pmatrix} a_1 \\ a_2 \\ a_3 \end{pmatrix} = 3a_1 (a_2 \cdot a_3 - a_3 \cdot a_2) - 3a_2 (a_1 \cdot a_3 - a_3 \cdot a_1) + 3a_3 (a_1 \cdot a_2 - a_2 \cdot a_1)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute the given values:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 3a_1 \\ 3a_2 \\ 3a_3 \end{pmatrix} \times \begin{pmatrix} a_1 \\ a_2 \\ a_3 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 3a_2 a_3 - 0 \\ 3a_1 a_3 - 0 \\ 0 - 3a_1 a_2 \end{pmatrix} = 3a_2 a_3 \mathbf{i} - 3a_1 a_3 \mathbf{j} - 3a_1 a_2 \mathbf{k}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a} = 3a_2 a_3 \mathbf{i} - 3a_1 a_3 \mathbf{j} - 3a_1 a_2 \mathbf{k}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, compute \(\mathbf{c} \times 2 \mathbf{b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
