[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute \( 54 \times 46 \) in your head, we can use the method of partial products. This involves breaking down the multiplication into more manageable parts.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here is how we can do it:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
