[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 54 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 46 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We will multiply these two numbers by breaking them down into parts where possible. Let's look at the numbers one by one:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Multiply \( 54 \) by \( 40 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 54 \times 40 = 54 \times (4 \times 10) = (54 \times 4) \times 10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Multiply \( 54 \) by \( 6 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 54 \times 6 = 324 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Multiply the result by \( 8 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 54 \times 8 = 432 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now let's put this in a box:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ (54 \times 40) + (54 \times 6) + (54 \times 8) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we need to compute each of these products:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 54 \times 40 = 2160 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 54 \times 6 = 324 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 54 \times 8 = 432 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Add these results together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 2160 + 324 + 432 = 2916 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, \( 54 \times 46 = 2916 \).
