[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Among these values, the only value that is approximately equal to \(\log_3 2\) is \(0.631\) (which is \(\log_3 2\)).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the smallest value is \(\boxed{0.631}\).
