[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the problem, we need to use the given information to find the value of \( f(7) \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The function is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(x) = ax^7 + bx^3 + cx - 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We are given:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(-7) = 7 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, substitute \( x = -7 \) into the function:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(-7) = a(-7)^7 + b(-7)^3 + c(-7) - 5 = 7 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, simplify the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -7^7 = -823543 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -7^3 = -343 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -7 \cdot 2 = -14 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(-7) = a(-823543) + b(-343) + c(-14) - 5 = 7 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -823543a - 343b - 14c - 5 = 7 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -823543a - 343b - 14c = 12 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we need to find \( f(7) \). Substitute \( x = 7 \) into the function:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(7) = a(7)^7 + b(7)^3 + c(7) - 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(7) = a(823543) + b(343) + c(7) - 5 \]
