[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m My friend reads three times as fast as I do. If it takes me 2 hours to read a novella, how many minutes will it take my friend to read the same novella?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
