[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \( p(-2) = 4 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \( p(4) = 4 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. \( p(5) = 16 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting these values into the polynomial, we get the following system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -27a - 9b - 3c + d = 4 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -8a + 4b - 2c + d = 4 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 16a + 64b + 4c + d = 4 \\
