[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We will solve this system step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the first equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -27a - 9b - 3c + d = 4 \implies -27a - 9b = 4 - d \implies -3(9a + 3b) = 4 - d \implies 3(9a + 3b) = d - 4
