[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      39 < x < 80
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Express \( x \) in terms of a square root:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Let \( x \) be a perfect square. If \( x \) is a perfect square, say \( x = n^2 \), then:
