[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m y&=3x+5 \\ 2y&=4x+5 \\ 3y&=9x-2 \\ 2y&=x-3 \\ 4y&=x-5.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{align*}Let's say that a pair of lines is $\emph{good}$ if the two lines are either parallel or perpendicular to each other.  Among all the pairs of lines shown, how many pairs are good?
