[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can express these points in terms of the normal vector to the plane, \(\mathbf{n} = (A, B, C)\), which can be derived as the cross product of \(\mathbf{B} - \mathbf{A}\) and \(\mathbf{C} - \mathbf{B}\).
