[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the first derived equation, we also know:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \triangle + q = 59
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can rearrange these equations to solve for \(\triangle\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
