[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Step 2: To complete the square, we need to add and subtract the square of half the coefficient of \(x\) (which is 4) on the left side of the equation.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[x^2 + 8x + 16 = 1 + 16\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
