[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[(x + 4)^2 = 17\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we know that the equation \((x + 4)^2 = 17\) is in the form \((x + a)^2 = b\). Here, the completed square form matches the given equation.
