[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the residue of \(-811\) modulo \(24\), we need to find an integer \(R\) such that \( -811 \equiv R \pmod{24} \). This means we need to find an equivalent positive integer \( R \) to \(-811\) where \(0 \leq R \leq 24\).
