[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For complex numbers $z$, let \[f(z) = \left\{
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{cl}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m z^{2}&\text{ if }z\text{ is not real}, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m z+2 &\text{ if }z\text{ is real}.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \right.\]Find $f(i)+f(1)+f(-1)+f(-i)$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find \( f(i) + f(1) + f(-1) + f(-i) \) for the function \( f(z) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(z) = \begin{cases} 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m z^2 & \text{if } z \text{ is not real}, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m z + 2 & \text{if } z \text{ is real}.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's determine the values of \( f(z) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - For \( z \) being real (i.e., \( z = x \) where \( x \) is real), \( f(x) = x + 2 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - For \( z \) being imaginary (i.e., \( z = i \) or \( z = -i \)), \( f(i) = i^2 = -1 \) and \( f(-i) = -i^2 = 1 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need to sum \( f(i) + f(1) + f(-1) + f(-i) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \( f(i) = i + 2 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \( f(1) = 1 + 2 = 3 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \( f(-1) = (-1) + 2 = 1 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. \( f(-i) = -i + 2 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Adding these values together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(i) + f(1) + f(-1) + f(-i) = (i + 2) + 3 + 1 + (-i + 2)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (i + 2) + 3 + 1 + (-i + 2) = i + 2 + 3 + 1 - i + 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (i - i) + (2 + 3 + 1 + 2) = 0 + 8 = 8
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{8}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
