[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(x + 1) = f(x) f(1) = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, set \( y = 1 \) again:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(x + 2) = f(x + 1 + 1) = f(x + 1) f(1) = 1 \cdot 1 = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This shows a periodicity of 2 in \( f(x) \). Therefore, we hypothesize \( f(x) = 3^{x-2} \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To verify this, we check:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(x + y) = 3^{(x + y) - 2} = 3^y \]
