[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(x) f(y) = 3^x \cdot 3^y = 3^{x + y} = 3^x \cdot 3^y \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Both sides match, confirming our hypothesis.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we find \( f(6) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
