[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the value of \(\sqrt{36 \times \sqrt{16}}\), we will break down the calculation into smaller steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Evaluate the inner square root:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{16} = 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Substitute this value back into the expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{36 \times 4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Simplify the expression inside the square root:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    36 \times 4 = 144
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{144}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Evaluate the outermost square root:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{144} = 12
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \(\sqrt{36 \times \sqrt{16}}\) is \(\boxed{12}\).<|endoftext|>
