[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 9. **Calculate the new yard length in terms of the new radius and the original radius:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The new yard length in terms of the new radius is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
