[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the sum of the first 10 odd positive integers, we can use the formula for the sum of an arithmetic series:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m S_n = \frac{n}{2} (a_1 + a_n)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m where:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( S_n \) is the sum of the first \( n \) terms,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( n \) is the number of terms,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( a_1 \) is the first term,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( a_n \) is the \( n \)-th term.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For the first 10 odd positive integers:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - the first term \( a_1 \) is 1 (the 1st odd number is 1),
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - the \( n \)-th term \( a_n \) is \( 2n - 1 \) (the \( n \)-th odd number is \( 2n - 1 \)).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need to find the sum of the first 10 terms of these integers. Plugging in the values, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m S_{10} = \frac{10}{2} (1 + (2 \cdot 10 - 1))
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, calculate the average of the first and last term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 + 19 = 20
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Then, multiply this average by 10:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 10 \times 20 = 200
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, divide by 2 to find the sum of the first 10 odd positive integers:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{200}
