[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the values of \( x \) that satisfy the equation \( |4x| + 3 = 35 \), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Isolate the absolute value expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    |4x| + 3 = 35
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Subtract 3 from both sides to isolate the absolute value:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    |4x| = 35 - 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplify the right-hand side:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    |4x| = 32
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Solve the absolute value equation:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The equation \( |4x| = 32 \) means that \( 4x \) can be either 32 or -32. Therefore, we set up two separate equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    4x = 32 \quad \text{or} \quad 4x = -32
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Solve each equation for \( x \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    For \( 4x = 32 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x = \frac{32}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x = 8
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    For \( 4x = -32 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x = \frac{-32}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x = -8
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **List the solutions:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The solutions to the equation are:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x = 8 \quad \text{or} \quad x = -8
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
