[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( F_3 = F_2 + F_1 = 1 + 1 = 2 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( F_4 = F_3 + F_2 = 2 + 1 = 3 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( F_5 = F_4 + F_3 = 3 + 2 = 5 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( F_6 = F_5 + F_4 = 5 + 3 = 8 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( F_7 = F_6 + F_5 = 8 + 5 = 13 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( F_8 = F_7 + F_6 = 13 + 8 = 21 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Notice the pattern:**
