[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The differences form a new sequence: \( 1, 0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, \ldots \), which suggests \( F_n, F_{n-1}, F_{n-2} \) repeated.
