[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Calculate \(7^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    7^2 = 49
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3(49) + 5(7) - 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Multiply each term by 3:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3 \times 49 = 147
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So the expression now is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    147 + 5(7) - 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. Multiply \(5\) by \(7\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    5 \times 7 = 35
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So the expression now is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    147 + 35 - 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. Add the numbers together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    147 + 35 = 182
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Then add \(-1\) to \(182\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    182 - 1 = 181
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression \(3x^2 + 5x - 1\) when \(x = 7\) is \(\boxed{181}\).<|endoftext|>
