[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the product of the two consecutive integers:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    7 \times 10 = 70
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
