[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine how many positive multiples of 7 are less than 150, we start by identifying the smallest multiple of 7 below 150. The smallest multiple of 7 is \(7 \times 1 = 7\). We can verify this by calculating \(7 \times 1 = 7\), which is indeed less than 150.
