[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Height from } 17 \text{ to } 13 = \sqrt{129 - \sqrt{276^2}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Calculate and multiply the bases and height to find the area:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Sum of the bases:
