[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Discard as height is not valid, recheck:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Sum of heights from 7 and 17 must sum to 4:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    17 \times 8 = 136
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
