[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m we will use the formula for the determinant of a 3x3 matrix. The determinant \( D \) of a matrix 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{vmatrix} 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a & b & c \\ 
