[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Step 4: Matching Integer Terms
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For integer terms, the coefficients must match. Without loss of generality, assume \( a \) and \( b \) are integers. Then the integer term \( a \) must match \( S(k) \).
