[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m **Inductive step:** Assume \( f(k) = 3^k \) for some positive integer \( k \). We need to show that \( f(k + 1) = 3^{k+1} \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(k + 1) = f(k) + f(1) \]
