[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can cancel one pair of numerators and denominators, which simplifies the product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{2 \times 3}{3 \times 4} \times \frac{4 \times 5}{5 \times 6} \times \dotsm \times \frac{8 \times 9}{9 \times 10}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
