[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we see the cancellation pattern again:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{2}{4} \times \frac{3}{4} \times \frac{4}{5} \times \dotsm \times \frac{9}{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This cancelation continues until we have fully canceled all the terms in the numerator and denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
