[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. The second term is \(3^0 + 3^1 = 1 + 3 = 4\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. The third term is \(3^0 + 3^1 + 3^2 = 1 + 3 + 9 = 13\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. The fourth term is \(3^0 + 3^1 + 3^2 + 3^3 = 1 + 3 + 9 + 27 = 30\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
