[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Conclusion:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - There are exactly 3 paths from vertex \( A \) to vertex \( B \) that pass through 3 adjacent vertices on the edges of the cube.
