[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify the given expression \(\left( \frac{4}{x} \right)^{-1} \left( \frac{3x^3}{x} \right)^2 \left( \frac{1}{2x} \right)^{-3}\), we will break it down step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's simplify each part of the expression individually.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Simplify \(\left( \frac{4}{x} \right)^{-1}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \left( \frac{4}{x} \right)^{-1} = \frac{x}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Simplify \(\left( \frac{3x^3}{x} \right)^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \left( \frac{3x^3}{x} \right)^2 = (3x^3)^2 = 9x^6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Simplify \(\left( \frac{1}{2x} \right)^{-3}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \left( \frac{1}{2x} \right)^{-3} = (2x)^3 = 8x^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, combine all the simplified parts:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{x}{4} \cdot 9x^6 \cdot 8x^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, multiply the constants:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{x}{4} \cdot 9 = \frac{9x}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{9x}{4} \cdot 8x^3 = \frac{9 \cdot 8}{4} \cdot x^{1+3} = \frac{72}{4} \cdot x^4 = 18x^4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the simplified expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{18x^4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
