[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the remainder when $6x^3-15x^2+21x-23$ is divided by $3x-6$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the remainder when the polynomial \(6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23\) is divided by \(3x - 6\), we will use polynomial long division. Here are the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Set up the division**: Write the polynomial \(6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23\) under the division symbol and \(3x - 6\) outside.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   3x - 6 & 6x^3 & -15x^2 & 21x & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Divide the leading terms**: Divide the leading term of the dividend \(6x^3\) by the leading term of the divisor \(3x\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{6x^3}{3x} = 2x^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Write \(2x^2\) above the division symbol.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   3x - 6 & 6x^3 & -15x^2 & 21x & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m          & 2x^2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Multiply and subtract**: Multiply \(2x^2\) by the divisor \(3x - 6\) and subtract the result from the original polynomial.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2x^2 \cdot (3x - 6) = 6x^3 - 12x^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   3x - 6 & 6x^3 & -15x^2 & 21x & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m          & 6x^3 & -12x^2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \hline
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m          & 0 & -3x^2 & 21x & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Repeat the process**: Divide the new polynomial \(-3x^2\) by \(3x\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{-3x^2}{3x} = -x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Write \(-x\) above the division symbol.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   3x - 6 & 6x^3 & -15x^2 & 21x & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m          & 2x^2 & -x \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Multiply and subtract**: Multiply \(-x\) by the divisor \(3x - 6\) and subtract the result from the current polynomial.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -(-x) \cdot (3x - 6) = 3x^2 - 6x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   3x - 6 & 6x^3 & -15x^2 & 21x & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m          & 6x^3 & -12x^2 & -3x^2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \hline
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m          & 0 & -29x & 3x & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Combine the results**: The remainder is the last term after subtraction.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -23
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the remainder when \(6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23\) is divided by \(3x - 6\) is \(\boxed{-23}\).<|endoftext|>
