[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m At the end of the year, the Math Club decided to hold an election for which 5 equal officer positions were available. However, 16 candidates were nominated, of whom 7 were past officers. Of all possible elections of the officers, how many will have at least 1 of the past officers?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the number of ways to choose 5 officers from 7 past officers and 8 current officers, we need to use combinatorial mathematics. Specifically, we need to calculate the number of combinations of 7 past officers and 8 current officers taken 5 at a time, without regard to the order within each officer position.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The number of ways to choose 5 officers from 7 past officers is given by the combination formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \binom{7}{5} = \frac{7!}{5!(7-5)!} = \frac{7!}{5!2!} = \frac{7 \times 6}{2 \times 1} = 21
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The number of ways to choose 5 officers from 8 current officers is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \binom{8}{5} = \frac{8!}{5!(8-5)!} = \frac{8!}{5!3!} = \frac{8 \times 7 \times 6}{3 \times 2 \times 1} = 56
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The total number of ways to choose 5 officers from 13 total officers (7 past officers + 8 current officers) is the product of these two combinations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \binom{7}{5} \times \binom{8}{5} = 21 \times 56 = 1176
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the number of ways to choose 5 officers with at least 1 of the past officers is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{1176}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
