[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, equate this to the right-hand side \(\log_x 2018\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \log_x 2018 = \log_x (2^2 \cdot 61) = 2 \log_x 2 + \log_x 61 = 2 \log_x 2 + \log (61^2) = 2 \log_x 2 + 2 \log_2 61
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
