[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, equate:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 \log_x 2 + 2 \log_2 61 + 2 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
