[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine \( A + B + C \) for the time \( A: B: C \) after 122 hours, 39 minutes, and 44 seconds, we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Calculate the number of minutes after 122 hours:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - There are 60 minutes in an hour.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( 122 \text{ hours} \times 60 \text{ minutes/hour} = 7320 \text{ minutes} \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Adjust for the additional minutes:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - There are 39 minutes left after 39 minutes.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The total minutes after adjusting for the 39 minutes is \( 7320 + 39 = 7359 \text{ minutes} \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the number of hours after 122 hours:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( 122 \text{ hours} \times 60 \text{ minutes/hour} = 7200 \text{ minutes} \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Subtract the minutes adjusted for the additional minutes: \( 7359 \text{ minutes} - 39 \text{ minutes} = 7320 \text{ minutes} \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Convert the remaining minutes to hours:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( 7320 \text{ minutes} \div 60 \text{ minutes/hour} = 127 \text{ hours} \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, after 122 hours, 39 minutes, and 44 seconds:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( A: B: C \) is 127 hours, 39 minutes, and 44 seconds.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Calculate \( A + B + C \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( A = 127 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( B = 39 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - \( C = 44 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    A + B + C = 127 + 39 + 44 = 190
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the value of \( A + B + C \) is \(\boxed{190}\).<|endoftext|>
