[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For the \(x\) term: \(3x + 7x^5 = 7x^5\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For the constant term: \(7 + 2 = 9\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
