[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Combine \(9\) and \(0x^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    0x^2 + 9 = 9
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the simplified expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    12x^2 + 3x + 9
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{12x^2 + 3x + 9}
