[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the sum of the digits of the base 7 representation of \(777_{10}\), we need to convert \(777_{10}\) to base 7 and then sum its digits.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we convert \(777_{10}\) to base 7. We do this by repeatedly dividing the number by 7 and recording the remainders:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 777 \div 7 = 111 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 111 \div 7 = 15 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 15 \div 7 = 2 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 \div 7 = 0 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get \(777_{10} = 2160_7\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we sum the digits of \(2160_7\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 + 1 + 6 + 0 = 9
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the sum of the digits of the base 7 representation of \(777_{10}\) is \(\boxed{9}\).<|endoftext|>
