[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \(7 \,\S\, 2\) based on the operation defined by \(a \,\S\, b = 3a + 5b\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Substitute \(a = 7\) and \(b = 2\) into the expression**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    7 \,\S\, 2 = 3(7) + 5(2)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Calculate the value of \(3(7)\)**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
