[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the value of \(5(2)\)**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
