[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Add the results from the previous steps**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    21 + 10 = 31
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \(7 \,\S\, 2\) is \(\boxed{31}\).<|endoftext|>
