[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Sure, let's break down the problem step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Calculate Malcolm's Time:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Malcolm runs at a speed of 6 minutes per mile.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The race is 10 miles long.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Therefore, Malcolm's time to finish the race is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \text{Malcolm's time} = 10 \text{ miles} \times 6 \text{ minutes per mile} = 60 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Determine Joshua's Time:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Joshua runs at a speed of 8 minutes per mile.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Joshua is also running for 10 miles.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Therefore, Joshua's time to finish the race is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \text{Joshua's time} = 10 \text{ miles} \times 8 \text{ minutes per mile} = 80 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the Difference in Time:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The time difference between when Malcolm crosses the finish line and when Joshua crosses the finish line is the time Joshua takes minus the time Malcolm takes.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - This difference is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \text{Time difference} = \text{Joshua's time} - \text{Malcolm's time} = 80 \text{ minutes} - 60 \text{ minutes} = 20 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, Joshua will cross the finish line \(\boxed{20}\) minutes after Malcolm crosses the finish line.<|endoftext|>
