[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Sum of the roots: \(x_1 + x_2 + x_3 + x_4 = b\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Sum of the product of roots taken two at a time: \(x_1x_2 + x_1x_3 + x_1x_4 + x_2x_3 + x_2x_4 + x_3x_4 = -1\)
