[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    40320 = 5^2 \cdot 3^2 \cdot n
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Divide \( 40320 \) by \( 2 \cdot 3^2 \cdot n \):**
