[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2 \cdot 3^2 \cdot n = 2^5 \cdot 3^2 \cdot \frac{n}{2}
