[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Since \( 2^4 = 16 \), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
