[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Substitute the factored form of $x^2 - 9$ back into the expression from step 1.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    7(x^2 - 9) = 7(x - 3)(x + 3)
