[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the prime factorization of 25000 is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 25000 = 2^2 \times 5^4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
