[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we take the square root of 25000:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{25000} = \sqrt{2^2 \times 5^4} = 2 \times 5^2 = 2 \times 25 = 50
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the simplified form of \(\sqrt{25000}\) is:
