[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the problem, we need to simplify the expression inside the cube root:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt[3]{3^5 + 3^5 + 3^5}
