[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since 729 is between 64 and 4, and the closest cubes are 333 (which is 4^3) and 729, the value we are looking for is most likely 4. But since we need an exact value and typically in such problems each successive integer cube root is an approximation, we can say:
