[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Jennifer and her friend Lisa ate 120 apples at her house and her friend Lisa ate 80 apples and 50 oranges, what percentage of the total pieces of fruit did Lisa eat? To determine the percentage of the total pieces of fruit that Lisa consumed, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Calculate the total number of pieces of fruit.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Calculate the percentage of the total pieces of fruit that Lisa consumed.
