[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m However, a simpler approach is to notice that the angles involved are not simple rational multiples of each other, so direct trigonometric substitution or simpler algebraic manipulation might be more appropriate. Instead, we will use known trigonometric identities and properties of angles.
