[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Combine the integer and the simplified fractional part:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The integer part is \(2\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The simplified fraction is \(\frac{6}{25}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the decimal \(2.24\) as a simplified fraction is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
