[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Jori has 2 gallons of distilled water.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Subtract the amount of water she used from the total amount:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Jori used \(\frac{7}{6}\) gallons of water.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    We set up the subtraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
