[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ s = 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ c = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \( t \) is:
