[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the pattern, we can see that the number of toothpicks used in the $n^{th}$ stage is given by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ T(n) = 2 + 2(n-1) = 2n. \]
