[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's place the triangle \( \triangle ABC \) on the coordinate plane with \( A \) at the origin \((0,0)\), \( B \) at \((8,0)\), and \( C \) at \((x, y)\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
