[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( AC = 17 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( BC = 15 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( AB = 8 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can use the distance formula to set up equations for the distances \( AC \), \( BC \), and \( AB \).
