[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - You use 2 quarts of milk.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - There are 2 pints in a quart.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Therefore, \( 2 \text{ quarts} \times 2 \text{ pints/quart} = 4 \text{ pints} \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Calculate the amount of milk required for 3 cookies:**
