[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, \( f(4) = 0 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we evaluate \( f(f(4)) = f(0) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 0 \text{ is even, so } f(0) = 0^2 - 4 \cdot 0 - 1. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculating the expression:
