[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, \( f(0) = -5 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we evaluate \( f(f(f(4))) = f(-5) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -5 \text{ is even, so } f(-5) = (-5)^2 - 4 \cdot (-5) - 1. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculating the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ (-5)^2 = 25, \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -4 \cdot (-5) = 20, \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 25 - 20 - 1 = 4. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, \( f(-5) = 4 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we evaluate \( f(f(f(f(4)))) = f(4) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( f(4) = 0 \), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(4) = 0. \]
