[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here is the Python code to calculate the velocity and then find out how long it takes for the air to travel 40 meters:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m import sympy as sp
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
