[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m # Velocity is given by v_peak = u_peak * cos(theta)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m # We don't actually need to solve for theta, but we'll use trigonometric identities to keep it simple
