[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m If $f(x)=\dfrac{x+1}{3x-4}$, what is the value of $f(5)$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find \( f(5) \) for the function \( f(x) = \dfrac{x+1}{3x-4} \), we need to substitute \( x = 5 \) into the function.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here are the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Start with the function:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(x) = \dfrac{x+1}{3x-4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Substitute \( x = 5 \) into the function:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(5) = \dfrac{5+1}{3 \cdot 5 - 4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Simplify the numerator and the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(5) = \dfrac{6}{15 - 4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Perform the subtraction in the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(5) = \dfrac{6}{11}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the value of \( f(5) \) is \(\boxed{\dfrac{6}{11}}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{6}{11}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
