[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the coefficients \(a\) and \(b\) of the polynomial \(3x^2 - 2x + 1\), we divide the polynomial by the given quadratic factor. The division of polynomials does not have a straightforward long-division method due to the high degree of the polynomial. However, we can use polynomial long division or synthetic division.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here, let's use synthetic division method for simplicity. We will divide \(3x^2 - 2x + 1\) by \(3x^2 - 2x + 1\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Set up the synthetic division:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      3x^2 - 2x + 1 & 3 & -2x & 1 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Bring down the first coefficient:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      3x^2 - 2x + 1 & 3 & -2x & 1 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        &   & ___ & ___ & ___ \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        & 3 & ___ & ___ & ___ \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Multiply and add:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      3x^2 - 2x + 1 & 3 & -2x & 1 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        & 3 & 6x & -3 & 7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        \hline
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        & 3 & 4x & 1 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Bring down the next coefficient:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      3x^2 - 2x + 1 & 3 & 4x & 1 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        &   & 6x & ___ & ___ \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        & 3 & 10x & -3 & ___ \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Multiply and add:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      3x^2 - 2x + 1 & 3 & 4x & 1 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        & 3 & 10x & 33 & -27 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        \hline
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        & 3 & 14x & 32 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Bring down the last coefficient:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      3x^2 - 2x + 1 & 3 & 14x & 32 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        &   & 34x & -38 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        \hline
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m        & 3 & 14x & 32 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
