[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. For \((a, b, c) = (3, 11, 2)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
