[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can cancel \(12!\) in the numerator and the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{4} = \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14 \times 13}{4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, let's compute \(\dbinom{16}{12}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{12} = \frac{16!}{12!(16-12)!} = \frac{16!}{12! \cdot 4!}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can cancel \(12!\) in the numerator and the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{12} = \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14}{12 \times 11 \times 10 \times 9}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we subtract \(\dbinom{16}{12}\) from \(\dbinom{16}{4}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{4} - \dbinom{16}{12} = \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14 \times 13}{4!} - \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14}{4! \cdot 12!}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Notice that \(4!\) appears in both terms. We can cancel \(4!\) from both terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{4} - \dbinom{16}{12} = \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14 \times 13}{4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1} - \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14}{4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1 \cdot 12!}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify the rest of the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{4} - \dbinom{16}{12} = \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14 \times 13}{4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1} - \frac{16 \times 15 \times 14}{4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1 \cdot 12!}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This reduces to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{4} - \dbinom{16}{12} = 2 \times 14 \times 13 \times 12 - 2 \times 14
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can factor out the common term \(2 \times 14\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dbinom{16}{4} - \dbinom{16}{12} = 2 \times 14 \times 13 \times 12
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, calculate the product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 \times 14 \times 13 \times 12 = 2 \times 2184 = 4368
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{4368}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
