[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the maximum number of workers the company can hire before the company has no money left and goes bankrupt is \(\boxed{10}\).<|endoftext|>
