[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2a + 3b + 5c + 7d &= 34 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3(d+c) &= b \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3b + c &= a \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m c - 1 &= d \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{align*} Given the above system of equations, find $a \cdot b \cdot c \cdot d$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2a + 3b + 5c + 7d &= 34 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3(d+c) &= b \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3b + c &= a \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m c - 1 &= d \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the first equation, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ b = 34 - 2a - 3c - 7d \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the second equation, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 3b + c = a \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting the value of \( b \) from the first equation, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 3(34 - 2a - 3c - 7d) + c = a \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 102 - 6a - 9c - 21d + c = a \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 102 - 5a - 9c - 21d = a \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 102 - 5a - 9c - 21d = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 5a + 9c + 21d = 102 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the third equation, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ c - 1 = d \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, we can express \( d \) as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ d = c - 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting \( d = c - 1 \) into the equation \( 5a + 9c + 21d = 102 \), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 5a + 9c + 21(c - 1) = 102 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 5a + 9c + 21c - 21 = 102 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 5a + 30c - 21 = 102 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 5a + 30c = 123 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a + 6c = 24.6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( a \cdot b \cdot c \cdot d = a \cdot (34 - 2a - 3c - 7d) \cdot c \cdot (c - 1) \), we can substitute \( a + 6c = 24.6 \) and \( c - 1 = d \) into this expression. However, it's more simpler to directly solve for \( a, b, c, d \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From \( 102 - 5a - 9c - 21d = 0 \) and substituting \( d = c - 1 \) and \( 102 - 5a - 9c - 21(c - 1) = 0 \), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 102 - 5a - 9c - 21c + 21 = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 102 - 5a - 30c = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 5a + 30c = 102 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a + 6c = 24.6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m And the product \( a \cdot b \cdot c \cdot d \) is:
