[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we sum these values:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
