[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the positive difference between \(2^5\) and \(5^2\), we first need to calculate each expression separately.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, calculate \(2^5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
