[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the positive difference between \(2^5\) and \(5^2\) is \(\boxed{7}\).<|endoftext|>
