[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For \( \theta \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ \theta = \tan^{-1}\left(\frac{-1}{1}\right) = \tan^{-1}(-1) = -\frac{\pi}{4} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since the point is in the \( xy \)-plane, we use \(-\frac{\pi}{4}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
