[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, $2343_6 = 567_{10}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Convert $15325_6$ to base 10:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The number $15325_6$ means:
