[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Calculating each term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    1 \cdot 1296 + 5 \cdot 216 + 3 \cdot 36 + 2 \cdot 6 + 5 \cdot 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
