[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 2473
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, $15325_6 = 2473_{10}$.
