[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m where:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( a_n \) is the \( n \)-th term,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( a_1 \) is the first term,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( d \) is the common difference, and
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( n \) is the number of terms.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In this sequence:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - The first term \( a_1 \) is 2.5.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - The common difference \( d \) is \( 5.5 - 2.5 = 3 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - The last term \( a_n \) is 83.5.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need to find \( n \) such that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a_n = a_1 + (n-1)d
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting the known values:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 83.5 = 2.5 + (n-1) \cdot 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, isolate the term involving \( n \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 83.5 = 2.5 + 3(n-1)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Subtract 2.5 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 81 = 3(n-1)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Divide both sides by 3:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 27 = n-1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Add 1 to both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
