[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m n = 28
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the number of terms in the list is \(\boxed{28}\).
