[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Solve for \(r\) by taking the square root of both sides:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
