[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the expression \(3 \cdot 5 \cdot 7 + 15 \div 3\), we will follow the order of operations, often remembered by the acronym PEMDAS (Parentheses, Exponents, Multiplication and Division (from left to right), Addition and Subtraction (from left to right)).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
