[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \text{Total weight} = 1250 \, \text{units} \times 100 \, \text{pounds/unit} = 125000 \, \text{pounds}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the amount of raw material required is:
