[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    24(7) = 168
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Combine these results:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2(2401) - 5801 + 1274 - 168 - 60
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplify step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    4802 - 5801 + 1274 - 168 - 60
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Calculate each term from right to left:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    4802 - 5801 = -1009
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    -1009 + 1274 = 265
