[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The complex number $(3 \operatorname{cis} 18^\circ)(-2\operatorname{cis} 37^\circ)$ is expressed in polar form as $r \operatorname{cis} \theta,$ where $r > 0$ and $0^\circ \le \theta < 360^\circ.$  Enter the ordered pair $(r, \theta).$
