[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The cross-product of two vectors \(\mathbf{u} = \begin{pmatrix} u_1 \\ u_2 \\ u_3 \end{pmatrix}\) and \(\mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} v_1 \\ v_2 \\ v_3 \end{pmatrix}\) is given by the determinant of the matrix formed by these vectors:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{u} \times \mathbf{v} = \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i & j & k \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m u_1 & u_2 & u_3 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m v_1 & v_2 & v_3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m where \(\mathbf{i}\), \(\mathbf{j}\), and \(\mathbf{k}\) are the unit vectors in the \(x\), \(y\), and \(z\) directions, respectively.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For the vectors \(\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ a \\ -7 \end{pmatrix}\) and \(\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ 4 \\ b \end{pmatrix}\), the cross-product is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 & a & -7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5 & 4 & b
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Expanding this determinant, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{i} \left( a \cdot b - (-7) \cdot 4 \right) - \mathbf{j} \left( 2 \cdot b - (-7) \cdot 5 \right) + \mathbf{k} \left( 2 \cdot 4 - a \cdot 5 \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = \mathbf{i} \left( a b + 28 \right) - \mathbf{j} \left( 2b + 35 \right) + \mathbf{k} \left( 8 - 5a \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a b + 28 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -2 b - 35 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 8 - 5a
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
