[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 8 - 5a = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We now solve each of these equations for \(a\) and \(b\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the first equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
