[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Substituting \( -x^3 \) into \( f(x) \)**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - We need to evaluate \( f(x) = |g(x^3)| \). We will use the property of \( g(x^3) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      f(x) = |g((-x^3))^3| = |g((-x)^3)^3| = |g(x)^3|
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
