[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Subtract 320 from 370 to get a remainder of 50.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    370 - 320 = 50
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Next, bring down the next 0 to make it 500:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    500 \div 80
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Perform the division**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - 80 goes into 500 six times because:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
