[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Subtract 480 from 500 to get a remainder of 20.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    500 - 480 = 20
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Next, bring down the next 0 to make it 200:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    200 \div 80
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Perform the division**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - 80 goes into 200 exactly 2 times because:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      80 \times 2 = 160
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Subtract 160 from 200 to get a remainder of 40.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    200 - 160 = 40
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Next, bring down the next 0 to make it 400:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    400 \div 80
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Perform the division**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - 80 goes into 400 exactly 5 times because:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      80 \times 5 = 400
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Subtract 400 from 400 to get a remainder of 0.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since the remainder is now 0, the division is complete. Therefore, the quotient is 0.4625.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Express the result as a terminating decimal**:
