[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The \(n\)-th term is clearly \(2001 + 7n\), which takes exactly 7 terms to reach the next term in the sequence, because \(2001 + 7n\) will be exactly 7 more than the starting term 2008.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the total number of terms:**
