[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    This confirms that 7 terms are needed to reach the next term, and the 8th term is indeed 7 more than the 7th term.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Conclusion:**
