[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute \( r = 7 \) and \( \theta = 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m L = \frac{1}{2} \cdot 7 \cdot 2 = 7
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the length of the arc of the sector is:
