[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can set up two equations to solve for \(x\) and \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \(\frac{1 + x}{2} = 3\)
