[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Solving for \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
