[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - In triangle \(ABD\), we know the following:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      AB = 10, \quad AD = 15, \quad BD = x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - We can use the Pythagorean theorem in triangle \(ABD\) to find \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      AB^2 = AD^2 + BD^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
