[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m r^2 - 16 = h^2 + 8hs - 16.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m r^2 = h^2 + 8hs.
