[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[\frac{\tan \frac{\pi}{5} + i}{\tan \frac{\pi}{5} - i}\]is a tenth root of unity.  In other words, it is equal to $\cos \frac{2n \pi}{10} + i \sin \frac{2n \pi}{10}$ for some integer $n$ between 0 and 9 inclusive.  Which value of $n$?
