[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Rewrite as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m r^2 + 2 + \frac{1}{r^2} = 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Subtract 2 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m r^2 + \frac{1}{r^2} = 1
