[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need to find \( r^3 + \frac{1}{r^3} \). Using the identity for \( r^3 + \frac{1}{r^3} \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
