[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m r^3 + \frac{1}{r^3} = r^3 + \frac{1}{r^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, for real numbers, \( r^3 + \frac{1}{r^3} = 3 \).
