[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for the constants \( t \) and \( u \) in the equation \(\overrightarrow{P} = t \overrightarrow{A} + u \overrightarrow{B}\), we need to understand the relationship between the points \( A \), \( B \), and \( P \).
