[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting the side length \( s = 2 \) into the formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m A = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{4} \times 2^2 = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{4} \times 4 = \sqrt{3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the area of the polygon is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{\sqrt{3}}
