[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we substitute this expansion into the original expression \((x+y)(x+y)^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
