[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x = 10,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m thus:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m xyz = 10 \cdot 36 \cdot 4 = 1440.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \(xyz\) is \(\boxed{1440}\).<|endoftext|>
