[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x^4 - 5x^2 + 20x - 18 - (x^2 - 4x + 4) = x^4 - 5x^2 + 20x - 18 - x^2 + 4x - 4 = x^4 - 6x^2 + 24x - 22
