[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 10. **Divide the leading term of the new dividend by the leading term of the divisor:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m     \frac{x^4}{x^2} = x^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m     So, the next term of the quotient is \(x^2\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 11. **Multiply the entire divisor by this term and subtract from the new dividend:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m     (x - 2)^2 = x^2 - 4x + 4
