[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. To eliminate the repeating part, we can multiply both sides of the equation by 100 (since the repeating part has two digits):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
