[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplifying this, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    99x = -x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Add \( x \) to both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
