[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    100x = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Divide both sides by 100:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Therefore, \( 0.\overline{10} = 0.101010\ldots = \frac{1}{9} \).
