[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Sure, let's break down the subtraction in base 7 step by step. The numbers we are subtracting are $4321_7$, $123_7$, $32_7$, and $21_7$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, convert these base 7 numbers to base 10.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Convert $4321_7$:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
