[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Convert $123_7$:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    123_7 = 1 \cdot 7^2 + 2 \cdot 7 + 3 = 49 + 14 + 3 = 66_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Convert $32_7$:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    32_7 = 3 \cdot 7 = 21_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Convert $21_7$:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    21_7 = 2 \cdot 7 + 1 = 14 + 1 = 15_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, perform the subtraction in base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1523_{10} - 66_{10} + 21_{10} - 15_{10} + 1_{10} = 1523 - 66 + 21 - 15 + 1 = 1405
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, convert $1405_{10}$ back to base 7. We do this by finding the largest powers of 7 that fit into 1405:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1405 \div 7 = 200 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 5 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 1405_{10} = 20020_7
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To get the digit 2, we need an additional 3, so we write an additional $3_7$:
