[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the quotient is 2 and the remainder is 2.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Divide the final quotient (2) by 6:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2 \div 6 = 0 \text{ with a remainder of } 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
