[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the slopes \(m\) of the asymptotes are \(\frac{4}{5}\) and \(-\frac{4}{5}\). Since the problem specifies that \(m\) is positive, we have \(m = \frac{4}{5}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \(m\) is \(\boxed{\frac{4}{5}}\).<|endoftext|>
