[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   1000\cdot \lfloor t\rfloor \rfloor$.  ( $\lfloor x \rfloor$ denotes the
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   greatest integer not exceeding $x$.)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
