[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \( y \) in the equation \( 4 + 2.3y = 1.7y - 20 \), we will follow a step-by-step approach to isolate \( y \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Line up the terms involving \( y \) on one side and the constant terms on the other side:**
