[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    4 + 2.3y = 1.7y - 20
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Subtract \( 1.7y \) from both sides to move all terms involving \( y \) to one side:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    4 + 2.3y - 1.7y = -20
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplify the left side:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    4 + 0.6y = -20
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Isolate the term involving \( y \) by subtracting 4 from both sides:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    0.6y = -20 - 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplify the right side:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    0.6y = -24
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Solve for \( y \) by dividing both sides by 0.6:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    y = \frac{-24}{0.6}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
