[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m g(x) = -2 + x - x^3 + 4x + 2
