[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To factor the expression \( (x^2 + 3x + 2)(x^2 + 7x + 12) + (x^2 + 5x - 6) \) into two non-constant polynomials, we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Expand the product \((x^2 + 3x + 2)(x^2 + 7x + 12)\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Add the resulting expression to \( (x^2 + 5x - 6) \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Factor out the common polynomial from the sum.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's start with the expansion of \((x^2 + 3x + 2)(x^2 + 7x + 12)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (x^2 + 3x + 2)(x^2 + 7x + 12) = x^2(x^2 + 7x + 12) + 3x(x^2 + 7x + 12) + 2(x^2 + 7x + 12)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, distribute each term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = x^4 + 7x^3 + 12x^2 + 3x^3 + 21x^2 + 36x + 2x^2 + 14x + 24
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = x^4 + (7x^3 + 3x^3) + (12x^2 + 21x^2 + 2x^2) + (36x + 14x) + 24
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = x^4 + 10x^3 + 35x^2 + 50x + 24
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we add this result to the polynomial \( x^2 + 5x - 6 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (x^4 + 10x^3 + 35x^2 + 50x + 24) + (x^2 + 5x - 6)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine all the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = x^4 + 10x^3 + 35x^2 + 50x + 24 + x^2 + 5x - 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = x^4 + 10x^3 + (35x^2 + x^2) + (50x + 5x) + (24 - 6)
