[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to factor out the common polynomial \( x^3 + 36x^2 + 55x + 18 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Notice that \( x^3 + 36x^2 + 55x + 18 \) is a sum of cubes, which can be factored as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
