[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute this back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^4 + 10x^3 + 36x^2 + 55x + 18 = (x + 6)(x^2 + 7x + 3)(x^2 + 3x + 6)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the factorization of the original expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
