[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we can rewrite the series as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sum_{n = 1}^\infty \frac{1}{n(n + 2)} = \sum_{n = 1}^\infty \left( \frac{1}{2n} - \frac{1}{2(n + 2)} \right)
