[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In the complex plane, a disk centered at \( z = 0 + 0i \) has a radius of 5. The area of a disk is given by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
