[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here, the radius \( r \) is 5. Therefore, the area of the disk is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
