[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Here, \(0.283283283\ldots\) is a repeating decimal with the repeating block "283283283" and has a length of 7 digits.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Simplify the repeating decimal:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Let \(x = 3.283283283\ldots\). Then, multiplying \(x\) by 10000 (since the repeating block has 4 digits) gives:
