[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a_0 = -32 - 810a_4. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( a_4 \) is a real number, \( a_4 \) can be any real number. For simplicity, let's assume \( a_4 = 0 \) (a common case when polynomials are not affine):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a_0 = -32, \]
