[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - If the path goes straight from $E$ to $G$ after passing through $E$, there is only one path.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - If there is a direct path or a path going diagonally from $E$ to $G$, we need to count all possible paths that go through $F$.
