[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify the expression \(1 + \cfrac{2}{3 + \cfrac{4}{5}}\), we will proceed step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we simplify the innermost fraction \(\frac{4}{5}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{4}{5} = \frac{4 \times 1}{5 \times 1} = \frac{4}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 + \cfrac{2}{3 + \cfrac{4}{5}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we need to simplify the denominator in the inner fraction \(\cfrac{4}{5}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3 + \cfrac{4}{5} = 3 + 0.8 = 3.8 = \frac{38}{10} = \frac{19}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Putting this back into the original expression, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 + \cfrac{2}{\frac{19}{5}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify \(\cfrac{2}{\frac{19}{5}}\), we multiply by the reciprocal of \(\cfrac{19}{5}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cfrac{2}{\frac{19}{5}} = 2 \times \cfrac{5}{19} = \frac{10}{19}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 + \frac{10}{19}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To add these two fractions, we need a common denominator. The common denominator is 19:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 = \frac{19}{19}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Adding the fractions, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{19}{19} + \frac{10}{19} = \frac{19 + 10}{19} = \frac{29}{19}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the simplified value of the expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{\frac{29}{19}}
