[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we add these fractions:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ CD = \frac{20}{12} + \frac{15}{12} + \frac{11}{12} = \frac{20 + 15 + 11}{12} = \frac{46}{12} = \frac{23}{6} \]
