[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's rewrite the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 22^2 \times 55^2 = 10^2 \times N^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculate \( 22^2 \) and \( 55^2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 22^2 = 484 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 55^2 = 3025 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute these values into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 484 \times 3025 = 10^2 \times N^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, calculate \( 10^2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 10^2 = 100 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 484 \times 3025 = 10 \times N^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, calculate the product \( 484 \times 3025 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 484 \times 3025 = 484 \times (3 \times 1025) = (484 \times 3) \times 1025 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, calculate \( 484 \times 3 \):
