[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \( N^2 \), divide both sides by 10:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ N^2 = 1805 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, take the square root of both sides to find \( N \):
