[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Arrange the odd letters (C, X):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Since all the letters are odd (C and X), they can be arranged in both order or in reverse order.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
