[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the problem, we need to find the coefficient of \(x^3\) in the product of the polynomials \(x^4 - 3x^3 + 5x^2 - 6x + 1\) and \(2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's distribute each term in the first polynomial to each term in the second polynomial.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The first polynomial is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[x^4 - 3x^3 + 5x^2 - 6x + 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Multiply each term by \(2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \(x^4 \cdot (2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7) = x^4 \cdot 2x^3 - x^4 \cdot 3x^2 + x^4 \cdot 4x + x^4 \cdot 7\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[= 2x^7 - 3x^6 + 4x^5 + 7x^4\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \(-3x^3 \cdot (2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7) = -3x^3 \cdot 2x^3 - (-3x^3) \cdot 3x^2 + (-3x^3) \cdot 4x + (-3x^3) \cdot 7\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[= -6x^6 + 9x^5 - 12x^4 - 21x^3\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \(5x^2 \cdot (2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7) = 5x^2 \cdot 2x^3 - 5x^2 \cdot 3x^2 + 5x^2 \cdot 4x + 5x^2 \cdot 7\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[= 10x^5 - 15x^4 + 20x^3 + 35x^2\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. \(-6x \cdot (2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7) = -6x \cdot 2x^3 - (-6x) \cdot 3x^2 - (-6x) \cdot 4x - (-6x) \cdot 7\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[= -12x^4 + 18x^3 + 24x^2 + 42x\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. \(1 \cdot (2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7) = 1 \cdot 2x^3 - 1 \cdot 3x^2 + 1 \cdot 4x + 1 \cdot 7\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[= 2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we combine all these terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2x^7 - 3x^6 + 4x^5 + 7x^4 - 6x^6 + 9x^5 - 12x^4 + 20x^3 + 10x^5 - 15x^4 + 24x^2 + 35x^2 + 42x + 2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x + 7\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = 2x^7 + (-3x^6 - 6x^6) + (4x^5 + 9x^5 - 12x^4 - 15x^4 + 20x^3 + 10x^5 + 24x^2 + 35x^2 + 42x + 4x + 7)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = 2x^7 - 9x^6 + 13x^5 - 37x^4 + 44x^3 + 47x^2 + 49x + 7
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
