[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This forms two distinct numbers: \(214\) and \(241\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m #### Case \(d = 3\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sigma^4 - \sigma = (3)^4 - 3 = 81 - 3 = 78
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This forms one distinct number: \(378\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m #### Case \(d = 4\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sigma^4 - \sigma = (4)^4 - 4 = 256 - 4 = 252
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This forms three distinct numbers: \(4252\), \(4251\), and \(4152\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m #### Case \(d = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sigma^4 - \sigma = (5)^4 - 5 = 625 - 5 = 620
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This forms one distinct number: \(5620\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Step 5: Identifying the Maximum Count
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the above cases, we see that the maximum count of \(\sigma^4 - \sigma\) is 3. To ensure that 3 is indeed the maximum, we need to test other values of \(d\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m #### Case \(d = 3\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sigma^4 - \sigma = (3)^4 - 3 = 81 - 3 = 78
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This forms one distinct number: \(378\).
