[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 2(3y) + 5y = 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 6y + 5y = 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 11y = 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ y = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, substitute \( y = 1 \) back into the equation \( 3y = x \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
