[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m I’ll solve this problem step-by-step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's find \( f(2,1) \). According to the definition:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(a,b) = \left\{
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{cl}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{ab - a + 2}{2a} & \text{if $a + b \le 3$}, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{ab - b - 2}{-2b} & \text{if $a + b > 3$}.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \right.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(2 + 1 = 3\), we use the first case since \(a + b \le 3\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(2,1) = \dfrac{2 \cdot 1 - 1 + 2}{2 \cdot 1} = \dfrac{2 - 1 + 2}{2} = \dfrac{3}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, let's find \( f(2,4) \). According to the definition:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
