[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \right.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(2 + 4 = 6\), we use the first case since \(a + b \le 3\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
