[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we add the results of \( f(2,1) \) and \( f(2,4) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
