[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[a_n = a_1 + (n-1)d\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We know the last term \(a_n = 3\). Substituting the known values into the formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[3 = 2008 + (n-1) \cdot 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplifying this equation, we have:
