[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, substitute \(A = 3\) and \(B = -5\) into the expression for \(C\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m C = -A - B = -3 - (-5) = 2.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the ordered triple \((A, B, C)\) is \(\boxed{(3, -5, 2)}\).<|endoftext|>
