[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[\sum_{n = 0}^{123456789} \frac{3n^2 + 9n + 7}{(n^2 + 3n + 2)^3} = \frac{a}{b},\]where $a$ and $b$ are relatively prime positive integers.  Find $b - a.$
