[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Let \(x = 16\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      16^2 + 4 \cdot 16 + 4 \cdot 16 \cdot \sqrt{16 + 3} = 256 + 64 + 64\sqrt{19} = 320 + 64\sqrt{19} \neq 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Let \(x = 5\):
