[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ A = \frac{1}{2} \cdot 28 \cdot 2^2 \cdot \cot \left(\frac{\pi}{28}\right) = \frac{1}{2} \cdot 28 \cdot 4 \cdot \cot \left(\frac{\pi}{28}\right) = 392 \cot \left(\frac{\pi}{28}\right) \]
