[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Certainly! Let's solve the equation \(2^n \cdot 4^n = 64^{n-36}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we express all terms with the same base:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(2^n\) can be written as \((2^4)^n = (16)^n\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(4^n\) can be written as \((2^2)^n = (2^4)^n = (16)^n\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(64^n\) can be written as \(4^5\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (16)^n \cdot (16)^n = (4^5)^{n-36}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Using the property of exponents \((a^m) \cdot (a^n) = a^{m+n}\), we can simplify both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (16)^{2n} = 4^{5(n-36)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now we can equate the exponents since the bases are the same:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2n = 5(n - 36)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Expanding the right side:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2n = 5n - 180
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Rearrange to solve for \(n\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2n - 5n = -180
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -3n = -180
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m n = \frac{-180}{-3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m n = 60
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So the solution is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{60}
