[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Suppose $11^5\equiv n\pmod 9$, where $0\le n<9$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the value of $n$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \( n \) in the congruence \( 11^5 \equiv n \pmod{9} \), we will first simplify \( 11^5 \) modulo 9. We do this by first reducing 11 modulo 9, since \( 11 \equiv 2 \pmod{9} \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 11 \equiv 2 \pmod{9}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to find \( 2^5 \pmod{9} \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2^5 = 32
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we reduce 32 modulo 9:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 32 \div 9 = 3 \text{ remainder } 5 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 32 \equiv 5 \pmod{9}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 11^5 \equiv 2^5 \pmod{9} \equiv 5 \pmod{9}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \( n \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
