[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine how many ounces of fiber the koala ate, we start with the information that the koala absorbs 25% of the fiber it eats, and he absorbed 10.5 ounces of fiber in one day.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we need to calculate the amount of fiber the koala absorbed. Since this is 25% of his intake, we can express this as:
