[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the fiber\_absorbed, we divide 10.5 ounces by 0.25:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ \text{fiber\_absorbed} = \frac{10.5}{0.25} = 42 \text{ ounces} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
