[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Area of the Shaded Area:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The area of the shaded area is the area of the gray rectangle minus the area of the white triangle:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \text{Area of shaded area} = 40 \text{ square units} - 25 \text{ square units} = 15 \text{ square units}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
