[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \frac{500}{13} \approx 38.4615
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Since \(k\) must be an integer, we round up to the next whole number, which is \(39\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the multiple of \(13\) by \(39\):**
