[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Chandra is going on a monster hunt and taking a photo of every monster she sees. She takes 30 minutes to take a close-up photo of a blue monster, 90 minutes for a red one, and x minutes for an orange one. If she has exhausted all 10 blue monsters and 15 red monsters, and took 15 minutes photos of each orange monster, how much time did she spend total taking photos of the monsters?
