[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \( d = 40 \), \( m = 30 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \( d = 60 \), \( m = 24 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \( d = 100 \), \( m = 20 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \( d = 120 \), \( m = 15 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \( d = 150 \), \( m = 10 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \( d = 200 \), \( m = 9 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \( d = 300 \), \( m = 6 \)
