[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Similarly, the area \(A_B\) of Circle \(B\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    A_B = \pi \times \text{radius}^2 = \pi \times 4^2 = 16\pi
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the area of the gray region:**
