[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1001_2 = 1 \cdot 2^3 + 0 \cdot 2^2 + 0 \cdot 2^1 + 1 \cdot 2^0 = 1 \cdot 8 + 0 \cdot 4 + 0 \cdot 2 + 1 \cdot 1 = 8 + 0 + 0 + 1 = 9_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, let's convert \(121_3\) (which is base 3) to base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
