[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The function \( g(x) \) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    g(x) = 3x + 7
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
