[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Let \( c = f(0) \). Then \( f(c) = \epsilon \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Substitute \( x = c \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
