[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Using the result from \( f(f(c)) = \epsilon \) for \( c = \epsilon \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
