[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    This suggests that \( f \) is constant. Let \( f(x) = \epsilon \) for all \( x \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Verify the solution:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    If \( f(x) = \epsilon \) for all \( x \), then:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
