[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a = 17 - \frac{2}{3} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a = \frac{51}{3} - \frac{2}{3} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a = \frac{49}{3} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now that we have the first term \(a = \frac{49}{3}\) and the common difference \(d = \frac{2}{3}\), we can find the eighth term \(a_8\). Using the formula for the \(n\)-th term again:
