[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Since \(0.5774\) is less than \(-4.4168\), we have \(\frac{1}{\sqrt{3}} < -\frac{12}{e}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combining all these comparisons, we have:
