[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the probability that the same number will be facing up on each of three standard six-sided dice that are tossed simultaneously? Express your answer as a common fraction.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the probability that the same number will be facing up on each of three standard six-sided dice that are tossed simultaneously, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes**: When three dice are rolled, each die has 6 faces. Therefore, the total number of possible outcomes is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    6 \times 6 \times 6 = 216
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Identify the number of favorable outcomes**: For the same number to appear on all three dice, it must appear on the first, third, and second dice (since rolling a die twice is independent). There are 6 outcomes in which each die shows the same number, specifically (1, 1, 1), (2, 2, 2), ..., (6, 6, 6). There are 6 such outcomes, so there are 6 favorable outcomes.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the probability**: The probability \( P \) that the same number will be facing up on each of the three dice is the number of favorable outcomes divided by the total number of possible outcomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    P = \frac{\text{Number of favorable outcomes}}{\text{Total number of possible outcomes}} = \frac{6}{216} = \frac{1}{36}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the probability that the same number will be facing up on each of three standard six-sided dice is \(\boxed{\frac{1}{36}}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1}{36}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Extracted Answer]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1}{36}
