[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \(7\): Possible pairs are \((7, 33)\) and \((2, 33)\), but 33 is not a prime number.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \(11\): Possible pairs are \((11, 30)\) and \((2, 30)\), but 30 is not a prime number.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \(13\): Possible pairs are \((13, 31)\) and \((2, 31)\), but 31 is not a prime number.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \(17\): Possible pairs are \((17, 23)\) and \((2, 23)\), but 2 is not a prime number.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \(19\): Possible pairs are \((19, 21)\) and \((2, 21)\), but 21 is not a prime number.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \(23\): Possible pairs are \((23, 20)\) and \((2, 20)\), but 20 is not a prime number.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For \(29\): Possible pairs are \((29, 11)\) and \((2, 11)\), but 11 is not a prime number.
