[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we can simplify the expression by canceling out the common factors:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[20 \cdot \frac{4}{25} \cdot \frac{9}{16} \cdot \frac{5}{9} = 20 \cdot \frac{4}{25} \cdot \frac{9}{16} \cdot \frac{5}{9} = 20 \cdot \frac{4}{25} \cdot \frac{9}{16} \cdot \frac{5}{9}.\]
