[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 34 = 2C
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Dividing both sides by 2, we find:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m C = 17
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
