[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the expanded form of \((x+3)(2x-4)(x-6)\) is \(\boxed{2x^3 - 10x^2 - 24x + 72}\).<|endoftext|>
