[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we need to find the sum of the roots \(a + b + c\). According to Vieta's formulas for the polynomial \(2x^3 - x^2 + 4x + 10 = 0\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a + b + c = \frac{1}{2}
