[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Distance \( CA \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m CA = \sqrt{(9 - (-6))^2 + (-2 - 6)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
