[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the units digit of $13^{2003}$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the units digit of \(13^{2003}\), we need to determine the remainder when \(13^{2003}\) is divided by 10. This is equivalent to finding \(13^{2003} \mod 10\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can observe the pattern in the units digits of the powers of 13:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 13^1 &\equiv 3 \mod 10, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 13^2 &\equiv 9 \mod 10, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 13^3 &\equiv 1 \mod 10, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 13^4 &\equiv 3 \mod 10, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m &\vdots
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We see that the units digits repeat every 4 numbers: 3, 9, 1, 3. Therefore, we need to find the remainder when 2003 is divided by 4.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Performing the division:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2003 \div 4 = 500 \text{ remainder } 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, \(2003 \equiv 3 \mod 4\). This means the units digit of \(13^{2003} = 13^3\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to find the units digit of \(13^3\). The units digit of powers of 3 repeats every 4 numbers: 3, 9, 7, 1. To find the units digit of \(3^3\), we look at the last three digits of 3: 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the units digit of \(13^3\) is 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the units digit of \(13^{2003}\) is \(\boxed{9}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
