[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the total distance the fly traveled over the course of all three parts is \(\boxed{354}\) feet.<|endoftext|>
