[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute the sum $\dbinom{4}{0} + \dbinom{4}{1} + \dbinom{4}{2} + \dbinom{4}{3} + \dbinom{4}{4}$, we will calculate each binomial coefficient individually and then sum them up.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
