[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 4 = 372 \) (1488 is divisible by 4)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 6 = 248 \) (1488 is divisible by 6)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 9 = 166 \) (1488 is divisible by 9)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 12 = 128 \) (1488 is divisible by 12)
