[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 28 = 54 \) (1488 is divisible by 28)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 32 = 45 \) (1488 is divisible by 32)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 372 = 4 \) (1488 is divisible by 372)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 744 = 1 \) (1488 is divisible by 744)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 126 = 12 \) (1488 is divisible by 126)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 168 = 9 \) (1488 is divisible by 168)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 104 = 14 \) (1488 is divisible by 104)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 94 = 16 \) (1488 is divisible by 94)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 78 = 19 \) (1488 is divisible by 78)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( 1488 \div 54 = 28 \) (1488 is divisible by 54)
