[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    y = \frac{169 \pm \sqrt{169^2 - 4 \cdot 169}}{2 \cdot 1} = \frac{169 \pm \sqrt{28561 - 676}}{2} = \frac{169 \pm \sqrt{27885}}{2}
