[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's calculate the number of zeros in \( 99,000,000 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 99,000,000 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This number contains 4 zeros because it has 4 '0's.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
