[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \(33 + 42 > 6\) or \(75 > 6\) (True)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \(33 + 6 > 42\) or \(39 > 42\) (False)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \(42 + 6 > 33\) or \(48 > 33\) (True)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
