[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \(42 + 5 > 33\) or \(47 > 33\) (True)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(33 + 42\) is not equal to 5, \(x = 5\) is not possible. We need to try 4. Let's check if \(x = 4\) is possible:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \(33 + 42 > 4\) or \(75 > 4\) (True)
