[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the problem, we need to determine the values of \(M\) and \(N\) and use them to find the value of \(\frac{a}{b} + b\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's find the maximum value \(M\) of the function \(f(x) = x^3 - ax - a\) on the interval \([0, 2]\). We start by finding the critical points by taking the derivative of \(f(x)\) and setting it to zero:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f'(x) = 3x^2 - a
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Setting \(f'(x) = 0\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3x^2 = a \implies x^2 = \frac{a}{3} \implies x = \pm \sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(x\) must be in the interval \([0, 2]\), we only consider \(x = \sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\) and \(x = -\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\). We evaluate \(f(x)\) at these points:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f\left(\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\right) = \left(\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\right)^3 - a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} - a = \frac{a\sqrt{a}}{3\sqrt{3}} - a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} - a = \frac{a^{3/2}}{3\sqrt{3}} - a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} - a
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f\left(-\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\right) = \left(-\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\right)^3 - a\left(-\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\right) - a = -\frac{a\sqrt{a}}{3\sqrt{3}} + a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} - a = -\frac{a^{3/2}}{3\sqrt{3}} + a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} - a
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Adding these two expressions together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f\left(\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\right) + f\left(-\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}\right) = \left(\frac{a\sqrt{a}}{3\sqrt{3}} - a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} - a\right) + \left(-\frac{a^{3/2}}{3\sqrt{3}} + a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} - a\right) = -2a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So the maximum value \(M\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m M = -2a\sqrt{\frac{a}{3}} \quad \text{and} \quad M^2 = 4a\left(\frac{a}{3}\right) = \frac{4a^2}{3}
