[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We are given that \(\overrightarrow{OM} \cdot \overrightarrow{ON} = 0\) and point \(M\) is on the line \(x = 2\), so \(M = 2\). Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4a\left(\frac{a}{3}\right) = 4a^2 = 4 \implies a = \frac{4}{\sqrt{3}} = \frac{4\sqrt{3}}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
