[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ B = \frac{85}{6} \approx 14.1667 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( B \) must be a whole number, we round up to the next whole number, which is 15. To confirm, if \( n = 6 \), \( B = 15 \) gives \( 15(15 - 1) = 15 \times 14 = 210 \), which is more than $80, so we need to check \( n = 5 \):
