[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The contrapositive of this proposition is "If \(x \neq 1\), then \(x^2 - 3x + 2 \neq 0\)".
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The contrapositive is true because if \(x \neq 1\), then \(x^2 - 3x + 2 \neq 0\).
