[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Proposition ③:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - We are given that \(p \vee \neg q\) (either \(p\) or \(\neg q\) is true), and \(\neg p\) implies \(q\).
