[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The difference between the new average and the current average, showing the increase, is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
