[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can simplify these equations to find the values of \(a\), \(b\), \(c\), and \(d\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. From the first equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ab = \frac{3 \cdot 5}{3} = 5 \implies b = \frac{5}{a}
