[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. From the second equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m bc = \frac{5 \cdot 6}{6} = 5 \implies c = \frac{5}{b} = \frac{5}{\frac{5}{a}} = a
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
