[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We know that \(\sin A = \cos (90^\circ - A) = \sin A\) and similarly for \(B\) and \(C\). Let \(\sin A = \cos (90^\circ - A) = \sin A\), we can solve these equations to find a consistent solution. By symmetry and setting \(p = 1\), \(q = 3\) (since we need positive integers), \(r = 5\) and \(s = 5\), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cos^2 C + \cos^2 A + 2 \sin C \sin A \cos B = \frac{1\cdot3\sqrt{5}}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cos^2 B + \cos^2 C + 2 \sin B \sin C \cos A = \frac{5\cdot1}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m By solving these, we find:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cos^2 C + \cos^2 A + 2 \sin C \sin A \cos B = \frac{1\cdot3\sqrt{5}}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cos^2 B + \cos^2 C + 2 \sin B \sin C \cos A = \frac{5\cdot1}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cos^2 C + \cos^2 A + 2 \sin C \sin A \cos B = \frac{1\cdot3\sqrt{1}}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cos^2 B + \cos^2 C + 2 \sin B \sin C \cos A = \frac{5\cdot1}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, \(\cos^2 C + \cos^2 A + 2 \sin C \sin A \cos B = \frac{1}{5}\), \(\cos^2 B + \cos^2 C + 2 \sin B \sin C \cos A = 1\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, we have \(p = 1\), \(q = 5\), \(r = 1\), and \(s = 5\), so \(\boxed{15}\).<|endoftext|>
