[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Numerator Simplification
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The numerator is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (1 + 17) \left( 1 + \dfrac{17}{2} \right) \left( 1 + \dfrac{17}{3} \right) \dotsm \left( 1 + \dfrac{17}{19} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
