[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let \( k = 2, 3, 4, \ldots, 19 \). Then:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
