[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This is a telescoping product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 18 + (17 + 19) + (17 + 19 + 20) + \cdots + (17 + 17 \cdot 19) = 18 + 36 + 45 + \cdots + 361
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since all terms cancel out except the last one, the numerator simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 18 + 36 + 45 + \cdots + 361 = \frac{(1 + 19) (18 + 19) (17 + 18) \dotsm 36 + 18}{(1 + 19) \cdot 18}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplifying further:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
