[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Since the side length of a square cannot be negative, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    s = 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Determine the perimeter of square \(PQRS\):**
