[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the area, in square units, of a circle with a circumference of $8\pi$ units? Express your answer in terms of $\pi$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
