[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Find the side length of the inscribed sphere:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The inscribed sphere touches the base of the hemisphere and all four faces of the hemisphere. This means the diameter of the inscribed sphere is equal to the radius of the hemisphere, which is 2. The radius of the inscribed sphere is therefore half of the diameter of the hemisphere:
