[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[5p - (5 + 125i) = 10000\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To isolate $p$, we first move the term involving $i$ to the other side of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
