[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    First, compute the dot product \(\bold{v} \cdot \bold{w}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \bold{v} \cdot \bold{w} = 2 \cdot 2 + 3 \cdot (-1) + (-1) \cdot 0
