[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This matrix \(\begin{pmatrix} 7 & -3 \\ 1 & 2 \end{pmatrix}\) has the inverse.<|endoftext|>
