[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This is not an integer, so 5 is not a factor of 3,403. Next, let's try 7:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 3,403 \div 7 = 482.0571 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This is not an integer, so 7 is not a factor of 3,403. We can continue this process until we find the next prime factor.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
