[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Compute \(2011 \mod 5\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2011 \div 5 = 402 \text{ remainder } 1 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2011 = 5 \cdot 402 + 1 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2011 \mod 5 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Compute \(2012 \mod 5\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2012 \div 5 = 402 \text{ remainder } 2 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2012 = 5 \cdot 402 + 2 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2012 \mod 5 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Compute \(2013 \mod 5\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2013 \div 5 = 402 \text{ remainder } 3 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2013 = 5 \cdot 402 + 3 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2013 \mod 5 = 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Compute \(2014 \mod 5\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2014 \div 5 = 402 \text{ remainder } 4 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2014 = 5 \cdot 402 + 4 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2014 \mod 5 = 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we have the values:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 \cdot 2 \cdot 3 \cdot 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Compute the product:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    1 \cdot 2 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2 \cdot 3 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    6 \cdot 4 = 24
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Compute \(24 \mod 5\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    24 \div 5 = 4 \text{ remainder } 4 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 24 = 5 \cdot 4 + 4 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 24 \mod 5 = 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{4}
