[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the greatest common factor of 84, 112 and 210?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the greatest common factor (GCF) of 84, 112, and 210, we will use the Euclidean algorithm, which involves repeated division.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's find the GCF of 84 and 112:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Divide 112 by 84 and find the remainder:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    112 \div 84 = 1 \quad \text{with a remainder of} \quad 112 - 84 \times 1 = 30 \quad (\text{since } 112 = 84 \times 1 + 30)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \gcd(112, 84) = \gcd(84, 30)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Next, let's find the GCF of 84 and 30:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    84 \div 30 = 2 \quad \text{with a remainder of} \quad 84 - 30 \times 2 = 14 \quad (\text{since } 84 = 30 \times 2 + 14)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \gcd(84, 30) = \gcd(30, 14)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Next, let's find the GCF of 30 and 14:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    30 \div 14 = 2 \quad \text{with a remainder of} \quad 30 - 14 \times 2 = 2 \quad (\text{since } 30 = 14 \times 2 + 2)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \gcd(30, 14) = 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
