[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    for some integer \( n \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Combine the Results:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Substitute \( k = 5m + 4 \) and \( k = 7n + 2 \) back into \( x = 4k + 1 \) to find \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
