[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's simplify the numerator and the denominator separately.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The numerator is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cos 5^\circ \cos 20^\circ + \cos 35^\circ \cos 50^\circ - \sin 5^\circ \sin 20^\circ - \sin 35^\circ \sin 50^\circ
