[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( T \) = weight of one treek
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( S \) = weight of one squig
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( G \) = weight of one goolee
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the problem statement, we have the following equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \( 10T = 3S \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \( 2T + G = S \)
