[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m However, there seems to be a misunderstanding in the problem statement. The area of the gray piece should be the area of the square \(e\) minus the area of the square \(ABCD\), which is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \text{Area of the gray piece} = 16 - 16 = 0 \text{ square inches}
