[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m However, we don't need to compute the specific values of \(P, Q, R, S, T, U, V, W\) explicitly. Instead, we can use the fact that the product of the terms is a well-known result that can be computed using properties of roots of unity and their sums.
