[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We compare this with the given quadratic expression \( 9x^2 + 24x + a \). By matching terms, we see that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m b^2 = 9 \implies b = 3 \quad \text{(since \( b \) must be a real number, we take the positive root)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m c^2 = a \implies c^2 = a
