[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[y = -\frac{68}{71}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(y = -\frac{68}{71}\) is not an integer, \(x = 7\) is not a solution.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's try \(x = 6\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[14(6) - 10(6)y - y = 166,\]
