[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m P(x^7) = 1 - \frac{1}{3}(x^7) + \frac{1}{6}(x^{14}) = 1 - \frac{1}{3}x^7 + \frac{1}{6}x^{14}
