[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    19x^5(3 - 10x^6)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Write the final factored form:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The expression \( 58x^5 - 203x^{11} \) factored completely is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \boxed{19x^5(3 - 10x^6)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]<|endoftext|>
