[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    89 + 92 + 88 + 95 + 91
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Calculate the sum:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    89 + 92 = 181
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    181 + 88 = 269
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    269 + 95 = 364
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    364 + 91 = 455
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the sum of the scores is \(455\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Count the number of scores:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Since there are 5 scores, we divide the sum by the number of scores to find the mean:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \frac{455}{5} = 91
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the arithmetic mean of the five scores is \(\boxed{91}\).<|endoftext|>
