[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 123456 = 101 \times 1214 + 21 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This tells us that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ n = 21 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the integer \( n \) that satisfies the given condition is:
