[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the projection of the vector \(\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}\) onto the vector \(\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{\begin{pmatrix} \frac{12}{13} \\ -\frac{18}{13} \end{pmatrix}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
