[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, isolate \( y \) by subtracting 12 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
