[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m y = 10
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the value of \( y \) is:
