[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Each of the ten volumes of the collected works of Theodore Sturgeon is available in paperback for $\$$15 or in hardcover for $\$$25. Theresa buys a copy of each of the ten volumes for a total of $\$$220. How many hardcover volumes did she buy?
