[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m If $\begin{vmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{vmatrix} = 4,$ then find
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} a & 7a + 3b \\ c & 7c  +3d \end{vmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the value of \(\begin{vmatrix} a & 7a + 3b \\ c & 7c + 3d \end{vmatrix}\), we start by using the property of determinants that states the determinant of a 2x2 matrix \(\begin{vmatrix} p & q \\ r & s \end{vmatrix}\) is \(ps - qr\). In our case, the matrix is \(\begin{vmatrix} a & 7a + 3b \\ c & 7c + 3d \end{vmatrix}\), and it is given that this determinant is 4. Therefore, we can write:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{vmatrix} a & 7a + 3b \\ c & 7c + 3d \end{vmatrix} = a(7c + 3d) - c(7a + 3b)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we distribute the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a(7c + 3d) - c(7a + 3b) = 7ac + 3ad - 7ac - 3bc = 3ad - 3bc
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Notice that all the terms \(-3bc\) cancel out, leaving us with:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3ad - 3bc = 3(a(d - b))
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since we know that \(\begin{vmatrix} a & 7a + 3b \\ c & 7c + 3d \end{vmatrix} = 4\), we can substitute the expression we just found into the determinant:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3(a(d - b)) = 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the value of the determinant is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
