[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The product of \(17 \cdot 18\) is 306. When 306 is divided by 4, the remainder is 2.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the modulo 4 residue of \(17 \cdot 18\) is \boxed{2}.<|endoftext|>
