[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given that the area is 400 square centimeters, we can set up the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
