[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To combine these fractions, we need a common denominator. The common denominator for \(x + 2\) and \(x + 9\) is \((x + 2)(x + 9)\). Rewrite each fraction with this common denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
