[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Add these expanded expressions together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^2 + 10x + 9 + x^2 + 10x + 16 = 2x^2 + 20x + 25
