[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the LHS becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{2x^2 + 20x + 25}{(x + 2)(x + 9)}
