[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, consider the right-hand side (RHS):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{x + 2}{x + 3} + \frac{x + 7}{x + 8}
