[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    This is also a contradiction. Therefore, there is no possible value for \(x\) from this equation either.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since neither equation provides a valid solution for \(x\), we conclude that there is no real value of \(x\) that satisfies the equation \((2008 + x)^2 = x^2\).
