[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m **Step 2: Calculate the probability of selecting a green ball from each container.**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The probability of selecting a green ball from Container A:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
