[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m **Step 3: Sum the probabilities of selecting a green ball from each container.**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
