[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Find all positive factors of 14**:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    A number's factors are the numbers that divide it without leaving a remainder. We can find the factors of 14 by checking which numbers from 1 to 14 divide 14 without leaving a remainder.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
