[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the problem \( 77 \cdot 88 \cdot 99 \equiv n \pmod{20} \), where \( 0 \le n < 20 \), we need to perform the multiplication and then reduce the result modulo 20. Let's go through the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. First, calculate the product of the numbers:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    77 \cdot 88 \cdot 99
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Factor out the largest possible factor of 2 from each number:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    77 = 7 \cdot 11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    88 = 2^3 \cdot 11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    99 = 3^2 \cdot 11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    77 \cdot 88 \cdot 99 = (7 \cdot 11) \cdot (2^3 \cdot 11) \cdot (3^2 \cdot 11) = 7 \cdot 2^3 \cdot 3^2 \cdot 11^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Now, calculate the product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    7 \cdot 2^3 \cdot 3^2 \cdot 11^2 = 7 \cdot 8 \cdot 9 \cdot 121
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    First, calculate \( 7 \cdot 8 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    7 \cdot 8 = 56
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Next, calculate \( 56 \cdot 9 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    56 \cdot 9 = 504
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Finally, calculate \( 504 \cdot 121 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    504 \cdot 121 = 57704
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    77 \cdot 88 \cdot 99 = 57704
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Now, reduce \( 57704 \) modulo 20:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    57704 \div 20 = 2885 \text{ remainder } 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    57704 \equiv 4 \pmod{20}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \( n \) is \(\boxed{4}\).<|endoftext|>
