[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[6^{50} \equiv 6 \cdot 5 = 30 \equiv 4 \pmod{13}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now we sum these values:
