[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the expression \(24^{50} - 15^{50}\) is congruent to \(6 - 15 = -9 \equiv 4\) modulo 13.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the remainder when \(24^{50} - 15^{50}\) is divided by 13 is \(\boxed{4}\).<|endoftext|>
