[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m When Frederick was born, his grandparents gave him a gift of $\$2000$, which was invested at a simple interest rate of $5\%$ per year.  How much money will Frederick have when he can collect the money at the age of $18$?  (Assume no money is added to the account besides the interest.)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine how much money Frederick will have when he can collect the money at the age of 18, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Calculate the interest earned on the initial investment:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Initial investment: \(\$2000\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Simple interest rate: \(5\%\) per year
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Number of years the money will be invested: \(2\) (since he will collect the money at age 18 after 2 years)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The formula for simple interest is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Interest} = \text{Principal} \times \text{Rate} \times \text{Time}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Plugging in the values:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Interest} = 2000 \times 0.05 \times 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Calculate the interest:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Interest} = 2000 \times 0.10 \times 2 = 400 \times 2 = 800
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the interest earned is \(\$800\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Add the interest to the initial investment to find the total amount:**
