[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, we need to match the terms correctly:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    9 = 0 \quad \text{(but we actually have a different form:)}
