[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    This means we need to solve:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    6y = c^2x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    For this to hold for all \( x \), the coefficient of \( x \) must be zero, which is not possible. Instead, we should look at the constant terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
