[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5 \times 7 = 35
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Among these, the smallest number is 10. To ensure we have considered the number with the fewest prime factors and the smallest odd factor, we should also check the number 12, which includes the prime factors 2, 3, 4, 6, and 12.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
