[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let \[f(x) = \left\{
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{cl}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ax+3 & \text{ if }x>0, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ab & \text{ if }x=0, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m bx+c & \text{ if }x<0.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \right.\]If $f(2)=5$, $f(0)=5$, and $f(-2)=-10$, and $a$, $b$, and $c$ are nonnegative integers, then what is $a+b+c$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\), we will use the given conditions:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \(f(2) = 5\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \(f(0) = 5\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \(f(-2) = -10\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This means:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(2) = 2a + 3 = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(0) = ab = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ f(-2) = -2b + c = -10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, solve for \(a\) from \(f(2) = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 2a + 3 = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 2a = 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ a = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, solve for \(b\) from \(f(0) = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ ab = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since we already have \(a = 1\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 1 \cdot b = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ b = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, solve for \(c\) from \(f(-2) = -10\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -2b + c = -10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute \(b = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -2(5) + c = -10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ -10 + c = -10 \]
