[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Step-by-Step Calculation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **First Number:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{First number} = 1
