[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - The sum of any two 6s is 12.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since 6 is not divisible by 3, we need to adjust to ensure the number is divisible by 3. We can achieve this by including a 6 in the tens digit that is different from 8.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
