[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Compute \( f(1 + g(2)) = f(1 + 3) \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    1 + 3 = 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Now, we need to find \( f(4) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(4) = 2(4) - 3 = 8 - 3 = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the value of \( f(1 + g(2)) \) is \(\boxed{5}\).<|endoftext|>
