[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The crease $\overline{PQ}$ will form an equilateral triangle with the crease line. To ensure the equilateral triangle, we need to find a point $Q$ such that the crease $\overline{PQ}$ forms an equilateral triangle with $P$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
