[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Convert the Map Distance to Actual Distance:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The map distance of 88 cm on the map represents 15 km in reality. To find the actual distance, we multiply the map distance by the map scale:
