[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 9 < x \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the first inequality simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
