[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 3 < \frac{3}{4}x \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we multiply both sides by \(\frac{4}{3}\) to isolate \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
