[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We are only interested in the non-negative value of \(x\), so we discard \(x = -2008\) and keep \(x = 2008\). To confirm this, we substitute \(x = 2008\) back into the original equation:
