[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the value of the expression $5^3 - 3 \times 5^2 + 3 \times 5 - 1$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the value of the expression \(5^3 - 3 \times 5^2 + 3 \times 5 - 1\), we will break it down step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, calculate \(5^3\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5^3 = 5 \times 5 \times 5 = 125
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, calculate \(3 \times 5^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3 \times 5^2 = 3 \times 25 = 75
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, substitute these values back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5^3 - 3 \times 5^2 + 3 \times 5 - 1 = 125 - 75 + 15 - 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine the terms step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 125 - 75 = 50
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 50 + 15 = 65
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 65 - 1 = 64
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{64}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
