[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Step 2: Convert the Surface Area to the Volume in Cubic Inches
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we need to find the volume \(V\) of the rectangular prism using the given dimensions:
