[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the smallest value of \(x\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{-\frac{4}{3}}
