[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the value of \( k \) such that \( f(x) = \cot \frac{x}{4} - \cot x \) can be written as \( f(x) = \frac{\sin kx}{\sin \frac{x}{4} \sin x} \), we start by using the cotangent subtraction formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cot A - \cot B = \frac{\sin (B - A)}{\sin A \sin B}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In our case, \( A = \frac{x}{4} \) and \( B = x \). Applying the cotangent subtraction formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cot \frac{x}{4} - \cot x = \frac{\sin \left( x - \frac{x}{4} \right)}{\sin \frac{x}{4} \sin x}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify the sine term inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cot \frac{x}{4} - \cot x = \frac{\sin \frac{3x}{4}}{\sin \frac{x}{4} \sin x}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we simplify the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sin \frac{x}{4} \sin x = \frac{1}{2} \sin x \cos x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cot \frac{x}{4} - \cot x = \frac{\sin \frac{3x}{4}}{\frac{1}{2} \sin x \cos x}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This can be further simplified to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cot \frac{x}{4} - \cot x = \frac{2 \sin \frac{3x}{4}}{\sin x \cos x}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We are given that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(x) = \cot \frac{x}{4} - \cot x = \frac{\sin kx}{\sin \frac{x}{4} \sin x}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m By comparing the two expressions, we identify that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{2 \sin \frac{3x}{4}}{\sin x \cos x} = \frac{\sin kx}{\sin \frac{x}{4} \sin x}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This implies that:
