[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Monica, who is 5 feet tall, is standing next to a pine tree that casts a shadow 34 feet long. If Monica's shadow is 2 feet long, how tall is the pine tree, in feet?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the height of the pine tree, we can use the concept of similar triangles. The height difference between Monica and the pine tree is the same as the difference in their heights. Since Monica is 5 feet tall and her shadow is 2 feet long, we can set up a proportional relationship as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \text{Height of the pine tree} = \text{Height of Monica} + \text{Shadow length of Monica's tree}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - Height of Monica (\(h_m\)) = 5 feet
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - Shadow of Monica's tree (\(s_m\)) = 2 feet
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - Shadow length of the pine tree (\(s_p\)) = 34 feet
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, substitute the known values into the proportional relationship:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m h_p = h_m + s_m
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m h_p = 5 + 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m h_p = 7 \text{ feet}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the height of the pine tree is \(\boxed{7}\) feet.<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Ground Truth]
