[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \frac{12 \text{ minutes}}{60 \text{ minutes per hour}} = 0.2 \text{ hours}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, it takes Stephan 0.2 hours to write all the possible rearrangements of his name.
