[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the real roots of the equation \((x - 7)(x - 3)(x + 1)(x + 5) = 1680\), we start by expanding the left-hand side of the equation. Let's rewrite the expression step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, expand \((x - 7)(x - 3)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (x - 7)(x - 3) = x^2 - 3x - 7x + 21 = x^2 - 10x + 21
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, expand \((x + 1)(x + 5)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (x + 1)(x + 5) = x^2 + 5x + x + 5 = x^2 + 6x + 5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, multiply all these expansions together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (x^2 - 10x + 21)(x^2 + 6x + 5)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can use the distributive property to expand this product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (x^2 - 10x + 21)(x^2 + 6x + 5) = x^2(x^2 + 6x + 5) - 10x(x^2 + 6x + 5) + 21(x^2 + 6x + 5)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Distribute each term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^2(x^2 + 6x + 5) = x^4 + 6x^3 + 5x^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -10x(x^2 + 6x + 5) = -10x^3 - 60x^2 - 50x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 21(x^2 + 6x + 5) = 21x^2 + 126x + 105
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine all these terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^4 + 6x^3 + 5x^2 - 10x^3 - 60x^2 - 50x + 21x^2 + 126x + 105
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^4 + (6x^3 - 10x^3) + (5x^2 - 60x^2 + 21x^2) + (-50x + 126x) + 105
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^4 - 4x^3 + 5x^2 + 76x + 105
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Set this equal to 1680:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^4 - 4x^3 + 5x^2 + 76x + 105 = 1680
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x^4 - 4x^3 + 5x^2 + 76x + 975 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the real roots, we need to solve this polynomial equation. We can use the Rational Root Theorem to test possible rational roots. The Rational Root Theorem suggests that any rational root, \(p/q\), is a factor of the constant term (975) divided by a factor of the leading coefficient (1). The possible rational roots are:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \pm 1, \pm 3, \pm 5, \pm 7, \pm 15, \pm 17.5, \pm 35, \pm 55, \pm 187.5, \pm 975
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Testing \(x = -8\) and \(x = -9\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (-8)^4 - 4(-8)^3 + 5(-8)^2 + 76(-8) + 975 = 4096 + 10240 + 320 - 608 + 975 = 18541 \neq 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (-9)^4 - 4(-9)^3 + 5(-9)^2 + 76(-9) + 975 = 6561 + 3240 + 405 - 704 + 975 = 10715 \neq 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Testing \(x = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5^4 - 4(5)^3 + 5(5)^2 + 76(5) + 975 = 625 - 500 + 125 + 380 + 975 = 2605 \neq 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
