[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left| \{ (3^x \cdot 3^y) \mid 0 \leq x \leq 3, 0 \leq y \leq 2, 0 \leq x \leq 3, 0 \leq y \leq 2 \} \right| = 3 \times 3 \times 3 = 27
