[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Calculate \( 40\% \) of \( 50\% \) of \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    40\% \text{ of } 0.50x = 0.40 \times 0.50x = 0.20x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. To find what percent of \( x \) this is, we need to determine what percentage \( 0.20x \) is of \( x \). This is given by the formula:
