[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For a constant $c,$ in spherical coordinates $(\rho,\theta,\phi),$ find the shape described by the equation
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[\theta = c.\](A) Line
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (B) Circle
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (C) Plane
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (D) Sphere
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (E) Cylinder
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (F) Cone
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
