[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, perform the arithmetic operations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 5 \\ -2 & 4 \end{pmatrix} + \begin{pmatrix} 0 & -3 \\ 8 & -5 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\ 6 & -1 \end{pmatrix}
