[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 9. **Notice that the expression \(\frac{\cos 2x}{(1 + \sin x + \cos x)(1 + \sin x - \cos x)}\) can be rewritten using the double-angle identity for cosine:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
