[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given that \(\mathbf{A}\) is a matrix such that \(\mathbf{A} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -15 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix}\), we need to find \(\mathbf{A}^5 \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's denote the matrix \(\mathbf{A}\) as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We know that \(\mathbf{A} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -15 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix}\). This means:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 5a - 2b \\ 5c - 2d \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -15 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From this, we can set up the following system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5a - 2b = -15 \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5c - 2d = 6 \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find \(\mathbf{A}^5 \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\), we need to express each element of \(\mathbf{A}^5 \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\) in terms of the previous powers of \(\mathbf{A}\). Let's denote \(\mathbf{A}^n \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\) as \(\mathbf{A}^{n+1} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Starting with the given:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -10 \\ -6 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m where:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & b \\ -c & d \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 2 & b \\ -c & d \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10 - 2b \\ 5c + 2d \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -10 \\ -6 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This gives us:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 10 - 2b = -10 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2b = 20 \quad \Rightarrow \quad b = 10
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5c + 2d = -6 \quad \text{(3)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, for \(\mathbf{A}^3\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{A}^3 = \mathbf{A}^2 \mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 10 \\ -c & d \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 5 & -2 \\ -2c & 4 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10 - 20c & -4 - 20 + 10c \\ -5c + 4d & -20 + 56 + 4d \\ 5 & 2d + 20 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10 - 20c & -6 - 20 \\ -5 + 4d & 20 + 4d \\ 5 & 2d + 20 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 10 - 20c & -6 - 20 \\ -5 + 4d & 20 + 4d \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10 - 20c + 35 \\ -25 + 10d - 8d \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 45 - 20c \\ -15 + 2d \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -15 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This gives us:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 10 - 20c = -15 \quad \Rightarrow \quad -20c = -25 \quad \Rightarrow \quad c = \frac{5}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -15 + 2d = 6 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2d = 21 \quad \Rightarrow \quad d = \frac{21}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{A}^5 = \begin{pmatrix} 10 - 20 \cdot \frac{5}{4} & -6 - 20 \\ -5 + 4 \cdot \frac{21}{2} & 20 + 4 \cdot \frac{21}{2} \\ 5 & 2 \cdot \frac{21}{2} + 20 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10 - 25 & -26 \\ 15 + 42 & 21 + 42 \\ 5 & 21 + 20 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -15 & -26 \\ 57 & 63 \\ 5 & 41 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we can find \(\mathbf{A}^5 \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{A}^5 \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -15 & -26 \\ 57 & 63 \\ 5 & 41 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -15 \cdot 5 - 26 \cdot (-2) \\ 57 \cdot 5 + 63 \cdot (-2) \\ 5 \cdot 5 + 41 \cdot (-2) \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -75 + 52 \\ 285 - 126 \\ 25 - 82 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -23 \\ 159 \\ -57 \end{pmatrix}
