[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the sum \( f(x) + g(x) + h(x) \) of the polynomials \( f(x) = -3x^2 + x - 4 \), \( g(x) = -5x^2 + 3x - 8 \), and \( h(x) = 5x^2 + 5x + 1 \), we will add the polynomials term by term, ensuring each term is simplified.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we write down the polynomials:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(x) = -3x^2 + x - 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m g(x) = -5x^2 + 3x - 8
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m h(x) = 5x^2 + 5x + 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we add the terms together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(x) + g(x) + h(x) = (-3x^2 + x - 4) + (-5x^2 + 3x - 8) + (5x^2 + 5x + 1)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Combine the \( x^2 \) terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -3x^2 - 5x^2 + 5x^2 = -3x^2 - 5x^2 + 5x^2 = -3x^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Combine the \( x \) terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m x - 3x + 5x = -2x + 5x = 3x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Combine the constant terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -4 - 8 + 1 = -11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Putting it all together, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(x) + g(x) + h(x) = -3x^2 + 3x - 11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{-3x^2 + 3x - 11}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
