[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Find the length of the curve {eq}y=(x^3+3)(e^{2x})/{(2-x^2)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m {/eq} from {eq}x=-1\; to\; x=1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m {/eq}. To find the length of the curve \( y = \frac{x^3 + 3}{2 - x^2} \) from \( x = -1 \) to \( x = 1 \), we use the arc length formula for a function \( y = f(x) \) over the interval \([a, b]\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m L = \int_a^b \sqrt{1 + \left( \frac{dy}{dx} \right)^2} \, dx
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we need to find the derivative \( \frac{dy}{dx} \). Given \( y = \frac{x^3 + 3}{2 - x^2} \), we use the quotient rule to differentiate:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{(2 - x^2) \cdot \frac{d}{dx}(x^3 + 3) - (x^3 + 3) \cdot \frac{d}{dx}(2 - x^2)}{(2 - x^2)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculate the derivatives:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{d}{dx}(x^3 + 3) = 3x^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{d}{dx}(2 - x^2) = -2x
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute these into the quotient rule:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{(2 - x^2)(3x^2) - (x^3 + 3)(-2x)}{(2 - x^2)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (2 - x^2)(3x^2) = 6x^2 - 3x^4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (x^3 + 3)(-2x) = -2x^4 - 6x^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{6x^2 - 3x^4 + 2x^4 + 6x^3}{(2 - x^2)^2} = \frac{3x^4 + 4x^3 + 6x^2}{(2 - x^2)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, square the derivative:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left( \frac{dy}{dx} \right)^2 = \left( \frac{3x^4 + 4x^3 + 6x^2}{(2 - x^2)^2} \right)^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine the terms in the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3x^4 + 4x^3 + 6x^2 = 3x^2(x^2 + \frac{4}{3}x + 2)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left( \frac{dy}{dx} \right)^2 = \frac{(3x^2(x^2 + \frac{4}{3}x + 2))^2}{(2 - x^2)^4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (3x^2(x^2 + \frac{4}{3}x + 2))^2 = 9x^4(x^2 + \frac{4}{3}x + 2)^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left( \frac{dy}{dx} \right)^2 = \frac{9x^4 (x^2 + \frac{4}{3}x + 2)^2}{(2 - x^2)^4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{1 + \left( \frac{dy}{dx} \right)^2} = \sqrt{1 + \frac{9x^4 (x^2 + \frac{4}{3}x + 2)^2}{(2 - x^2)^4}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This expression is quite complex, so we will use a different method to find the arc length. We use the arc length formula for a function \( y = f(x) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
