[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This integral is quite complex, so we will use numerical methods or software to approximate the value. However, for the sake of this problem, we will use a numerical integration method or software to find the length.
