[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 64 + 34\sqrt{7} + 26 + 20\sqrt{7} + 260
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 360 + 54\sqrt{7}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Compute the dot product \(\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b} = \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    1 & -2 & -5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt{7} & 4 & -1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    13 & -4 & 17
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Expanding the determinant:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b} = 1 \cdot (4 \cdot 17 - (-1) \cdot (-4)) - (-2) \cdot (\sqrt{7} \cdot 17 - (-1) \cdot 13) + (-5) \cdot (\sqrt{7} \cdot (-4) - 4 \cdot 13)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplify each term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 1 \cdot (68 - 4) + 2 \cdot (17\sqrt{7} + 13) - 5 \cdot (-4\sqrt{7} - 52)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
