[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's calculate the perimeter of the triangle. The side lengths given are \( AB = 5 \), \( BC = 6 \), and \( AC = 7 \). The perimeter \( P \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m P = AB + BC + AC = 5 + 6 + 7 = 18
