[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The two bugs start crawling at the same speed and meet at a certain point \( D \) between \( A \) and \( B \) along the perimeter of the triangle. Since they meet at point \( D \), the distance between \( A \) and \( D \) is equal to the distance between \( B \) and \( C \), which is \( BC = 6 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
