[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the other crossing point is \((2, -5)\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the two crossing points are:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
