[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, we need to evaluate \( f(f(f(2))) = f(7) \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( 7 \geq 4 \), we use the second case of the function definition again:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(7) = 3 \cdot 7 - 2 = 21 - 2 = 19
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
