[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Find the unit vector $\mathbf{v},$ lying in the $xz$-plane, which makes an angle of $45^\circ$ with $\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 2 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix},$ and an angle of $60^\circ$ with $\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ - 1 \end{pmatrix}.$
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the unit vector \(\mathbf{v}\) lying in the \(xz\)-plane that makes angles of \(45^\circ\) with \(\mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 2 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix}\) and \(60^\circ\) with \(\mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix}\), we will use the fact that the unit vector \(\mathbf{v}\) can be expressed as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{v} = \frac{\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b}}{\|\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b}\|}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we calculate the cross product \(\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b} = \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 & 2 & -1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 0 & 1 & -1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{vmatrix} = \mathbf{i}(2 \cdot -1 - (-1) \cdot 1) - \mathbf{j}(2 \cdot -1 - (-1) \cdot 0) + \mathbf{k}(2 \cdot 1 - 2 \cdot 0)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m = \mathbf{i}(-2 + 1) - \mathbf{j}(-2) + \mathbf{k}(2) = \mathbf{i}(-1) + \mathbf{j}(2) + \mathbf{k}(2) = \begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 2 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we calculate the magnitude of \(\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \|\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b}\| = \sqrt{(-1)^2 + 2^2 + 2^2} = \sqrt{1 + 4 + 4} = \sqrt{9} = 3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The unit vector \(\mathbf{v}\) is then:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{v} = \frac{\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 2 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}}{3} = \begin{pmatrix} -\frac{1}{3} \\ \frac{2}{3} \\ \frac{2}{3} \end{pmatrix}
