[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can express \( \cos 4x \) and \( \cos 2x \) in terms of \(\cos 2x\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
