[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting these back into the function:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m f(x) = 2 \cos^2 2x - 1 + 2k^2 - 1 - \frac{1}{2} (2k^2 - 1) = 2 \cos^2 2x - \cos 2x - \frac{1}{2} (2k^2 - 1) = 2 \cos^2 2x - \cos 2x - k^2 + \frac{1}{2}
