[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m As \( k \) varies over \([-1, 1]\), \( \cos 2x \) varies over \([-1, 1]\), and thus \( 3 - k^2 \) varies over \([-2, 2]\). Therefore, the range of \( f(x) \) is \([-2, 2]\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the range of the function \( f(x) = \sin^4 x - \sin x \cos x + \cos^4 x \) is:
