[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(13 = 13\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(12 = 2^2 \times 3\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(11 = 11\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(10 = 2 \times 5\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, calculate the product:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 14 \times 13 \times 12 \times 11 \times 10 = (2 \times 7) \times (13) \times (2^2 \times 3) \times (11) \times (2 \times 5)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (2 \times 7) \times (13) \times 2^2 \times 3 \times 11 \times 2 \times 5 = (2 \times 7 \times 2 \times 2) \times (13) \times 3 \times 5 \times 11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify further:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (2 \times 2 \times 2) \times (13) \times 3 \times 5 \times 11 = 8 \times (13) \times 3 \times 5 \times 11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculate the product inside:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 8 \times 3 \times 5 \times 11 = 48 \times 55 = 2640
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we have the product of the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2640
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
