[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the coordinates of point \( B \) are \( (4, -13) \). To find the sum of the coordinates of point \( B \):
