[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify \(\sqrt{15} \cdot \sqrt{35}\), we can use the property of square roots that states \(\sqrt{a} \cdot \sqrt{b} = \sqrt{a \cdot b}\). Applying this property, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{15} \cdot \sqrt{35} = \sqrt{15 \cdot 35}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we need to calculate the product inside the square root:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 15 \cdot 35 = 15 \cdot (30 + 5) = 15 \cdot 30 + 15 \cdot 5 = 450 + 75 = 525
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{15 \cdot 35} = \sqrt{525}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to simplify \(\sqrt{525}\). We begin by factoring 525 into its prime factors:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 525 = 3 \cdot 5^2 \cdot 7
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Using these factors, we can rewrite the square root as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{525} = \sqrt{3 \cdot 5^2 \cdot 7}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can separate the square root into the product of the square roots of the factors:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{525} = \sqrt{3 \cdot 5^2 \cdot 7} = \sqrt{3} \cdot \sqrt{5^2} \cdot \sqrt{7} = \sqrt{3} \cdot 5 \cdot \sqrt{7} = 5\sqrt{21}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the simplified form of \(\sqrt{15} \cdot \sqrt{35}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{5\sqrt{21}}
