[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The smallest multiple of 3 is 3 and the largest is 2004 (since \(3 \times 668 = 1904\) and \(3 \times 669 = 2007\)). The number of terms in this arithmetic sequence is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \left\lfloor \frac{2005}{3} \right\rfloor - \left\lceil \frac{2004}{3} \right\rceil = 668 - 667 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, there is 1 multiple of 3 between 1 and 2005.
