[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, there are 2 multiples of 4 between 1 and 2005.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Count the number of multiples of 12 between 1 and 2005:**
