[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, there are 0 multiples of 12 between 1 and 2005.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Use the principle of inclusion-exclusion to find the number of multiples of 3 or 4:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The number of multiples of 3 or 4 is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
