[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3(r - 5) = 24
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3r - 15 = 24
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Isolate the term with \( r \) by adding 15 to both sides of the equation:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
