[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify the expression \(-3(1+4i)+i(-2-i)\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Distribute \(-3\) through the first set of parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
