[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Distribute \(i\) through the second set of parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m i(-2-i) = (i \cdot -2) + (i \cdot -i) = -2i - (-1) = -2i + 1 = 1 - 2i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Combine the two results from steps 1 and 2:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -3 - 12i + 1 - 2i = (-3 + 1) + (-12i - 2i) = -2 - 14i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the simplified form of the expression is:
