[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Option B: \( 2022a = 1940b - 8000 \).**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Rearranging the equation, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      2022a = 1940b - 8000
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
