[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2x + 10 = 120
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Solve the equation \( 2x + 10 = 120 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
