[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve for \( a \) in the equation \(\dfrac{8^{-1}}{4^{-1}} - a^{-1} = 1\), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Simplify the left-hand side of the equation.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Isolate the term with \( a \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Solve for \( a \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's start with the given equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{8^{-1}}{4^{-1}} - a^{-1} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, simplify the fraction \(\dfrac{8^{-1}}{4^{-1}}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 8^{-1} = \dfrac{1}{8} \quad \text{and} \quad 4^{-1} = \dfrac{1}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{8^{-1}}{4^{-1}} = \dfrac{\dfrac{1}{8}}{\dfrac{1}{4}} = \dfrac{1}{8} \cdot \dfrac{4}{1} = \dfrac{4}{8} = \dfrac{1}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, substitute this back into the original equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{1}{2} - a^{-1} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, isolate \( a^{-1} \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{1}{2} - 1 = a^{-1}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{1}{2} - \dfrac{2}{2} = a^{-1}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \dfrac{-1}{2} = a^{-1}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a^{-1} = -\dfrac{1}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We know that \( a^{-1} = \dfrac{1}{a} \), so:
