[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To calculate the product \(\frac{5}{3} \times \frac{6}{10} \times \frac{15}{9} \times \frac{12}{20} \times \frac{25}{15} \times \frac{18}{30} \times \frac{35}{21} \times \frac{24}{40}\), we will simplify each fraction step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's simplify each fraction individually:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{5}{3}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{6}{10} = \frac{3}{5}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{15}{9} = \frac{5}{3}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{12}{20} = \frac{3}{5}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{25}{15} = \frac{5}{3}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{18}{30} = \frac{3}{5}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{35}{21} = \frac{5}{3}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \(\frac{24}{40} = \frac{3}{5}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, let's combine all the fractions:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{3}{5} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{3}{5} \times \frac{3}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Notice that this is a product of five \(\frac{5}{3}\)'s:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3} \times \frac{5}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since each of these fractions is equal to \(\frac{5^5}{3^5}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{5^5}{3^5} \times 5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculate \(5^2\) (which is \(5 \times 5\)):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5^2 = 25
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{25}{3^5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Calculate \(3^5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3^5 = 3 \times 3 \times 3 \times 3 \times 3 = 243
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the product becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{25}{243}
