[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Calculate \(5(-1)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    5(-1) = -5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. Substitute these values back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    1 - 5 - 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. Perform the subtraction step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    1 - 5 = -4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    -4 - 6 = -10
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the value of the expression \(x^2 + 5x - 6\) when \(x = -1\) is \(\boxed{-10}\).<|endoftext|>
