[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      y = 1 \sin \alpha + 1 \cos \alpha
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - For point \((1, 1)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
