[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to check the value of the function at \( x = 0 \) (since there is no clear maximum value in the interval \( -1 \le x \le 1 \) and considering the symmetry of the function, we can also directly evaluate at other points).
