[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Compute \(2^2 + 1^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2^2 = 4 \quad \text{and} \quad 1^2 = 1 \quad \text{so} \quad 2^2 + 1^2 = 4 + 1 = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Compute \(2^4 + 1^4\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2^4 = 16 \quad \text{and} \quad 1^4 = 1 \quad \text{so} \quad 2^4 + 1^4 = 16 + 1 = 17
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we can substitute these values back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
