[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Now, multiply 5 by \(\frac{5}{6}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
