[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the area of the triangle with vertices \((6,5,3)\), \((3,3,1)\), and \((15,11,9)\), we can use the formula for the area of a triangle given by the vertices \((x_1, y_1, z_1)\), \((x_2, y_2, z_2)\), and \((x_3, y_3, z_3)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
