[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we need to find two vectors that lie on the plane of the triangle. We can use the vectors \(\vec{AB}\) and \(\vec{AC}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \vec{AB} = (3-6, 3-5, 1-3) = (-3, -2, -2)
