[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the problem, we start by noting that we have a triangle \(ABC\) with angles \(A\), \(B\), and \(C\). It is given that the measure of angle \(C\) is double the measure of angle \(B\). We can express this relationship as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
