[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ A = 180^\circ - 3 \times 36^\circ \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ A = 180^\circ - 108^\circ \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ A = 72^\circ \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, if angle \(B\) is 36 degrees, then the measure of angle \(A\) is:
