[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify \((5-3i)(-4+3i)\), we will use the distributive property (also known as the FOIL method for binomials). The distributive property states that for any two binomials \(A\) and \(B\), \(A(B+C) = AB + AC\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here, \(A = 5-3i\), \(B = -4+3i\), so \(C = 3i\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, distribute \(5-3i\) to \(3i\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (5-3i)(-4+3i) = (5)(-4) + (5)(3i) + (-3i)(-4) + (-3i)(3i)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, perform each multiplication:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (5)(-4) = -20
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (5)(3i) = 15i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (-3i)(-4) = 12i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (-3i)(3i) = -9i^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, combine these results:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -20 + 15i + 12i - 9i^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combine the like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -20 - 9i^2 + 15i + 12i = -20 - 9i^2 + 27i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Recall that \(i^2 = -1\), so substitute \(-1\) for \(i^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -20 - 9(-1) + 27i = -20 + 9 + 27i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify the constants:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -20 + 9 + 27i = -11 + 27i
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the simplified form of \((5-3i)(-4+3i)\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{-11 + 27i}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
