[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The prime factorization of \( 17 \) is \( 17 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The prime factorization of \( 6 \) is \( 2 \times 3 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The LCM is found by taking the highest power of each prime that appears in the factorizations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \text{LCM}(17, 6) = 17 \times 2 \times 3 = 102
