[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The resulting number is the product of \( 17 \times 6 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      17 \times 6 = 102
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **LCM of \( 17 \), \( 6 \), and \( 2 \) with \( 102 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The result from step 2:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
