[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[64^{1/2} = \sqrt{64} = 8.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, let's evaluate \(27^{-1/3}\):
