[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, let's evaluate \(16^{1/4}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[16^{1/4} = 16^{1/4} = (2^4)^{1/4} = 2.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Putting it all together, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[64^{1/2} \cdot 27^{-1/3} \cdot 16^{1/4} = 8 \cdot \frac{1}{3} \cdot 2.\]
