[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Mary wants to buy one large pizza, two medium pizzas, two subs, seven drinks, and four dessert cups. The price of each burger meal is exactly half the total price of two medium pizzas and five medium burgers. If the price of a medium burger is '$1.49', calculate the total amount of money Mary needs to pay, in dollars. To determine the total amount of money Mary needs to pay, we need to break down the costs step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
