[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m -35 + 35 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 0 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This confirms our values are correct.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
