[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the number of positive multiples of \(7\) that are less than \(1000\) and end with the digit \(3\) is \(\boxed{128}\).<|endoftext|>
