[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m **Step 1: Simplify \((7b^3)^2\).**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (7b^3)^2 = 7^2 \cdot (b^3)^2 = 49b^6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m **Step 2: Simplify \((4b^2)^{-3}\).**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (4b^2)^{-3} = 4^{-3} \cdot (b^2)^{-3} = \left(\frac{1}{4}\right)^3 \cdot b^{2 \cdot -3} = \frac{1}{64} \cdot b^{-6} = \frac{b^{-6}}{64}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m **Step 3: Multiply the results from steps 1 and 2.**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 49b^6 \cdot \frac{b^{-6}}{64} = 49 \cdot \frac{1}{64} \cdot b^{6} \cdot b^{-6} = \frac{49}{64} \cdot b^{5} = \frac{49b^5}{64}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the simplified expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{\frac{49b^5}{64}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
