[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m we need to express \( x \) and \( y \) in terms of the parameter \( t \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( x = -7 + tl \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - \( y = s - 5t \)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, substitute these expressions into the equation of the line:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m y = \frac{1}{2} x + 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute \( x = -7 + tl \) and \( y = s - 5t \) into \( y = \frac{1}{2} x + 4 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m s - 5t = \frac{1}{2} \left( -7 + tl \right) + 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplify the right-hand side:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m s - 5t = \frac{1}{2} \cdot (-7) + \frac{1}{2} \cdot tl + 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m s - 5t = -\frac{7}{2} + \frac{tl}{2} + 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m s - 5t = -\frac{7}{2} + \frac{tl}{2} + \frac{8}{2}
