[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Multiply both sides by 2 to clear the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2s - 10t = 1 + tl
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Rearrange to isolate \( s \) and \( l \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
