[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 2 + 3 + 0 + (f(11) + f(2)) + 3 + 0 + f(4) + f(5)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Substituting the values from above:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 2 + 3 + 0 + (2 + f(11)) + 3 + 0 + f(4) + f(5)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Simplifying further:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 2 + 3 + 0 + 2 + 3 + 0 + f(4) + f(5)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    = 10 + f(4) + f(5)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Calculate \( f(4) \) and \( f(5) \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(4) = 4^2 - 2 \cdot 4 + 3 = 16 - 8 + 3 = 11
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(5) = 5 - 3 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. **Substitute back into the sum:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    10 + f(4) + f(5) = 10 + 11 + 2 = 23
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of \( f(f(1)) + f(f(2)) + f(f(3)) + \cdots + f(f(9)) \) is \(\boxed{23}\).<|endoftext|>
