[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the determinant of the matrix whose column vectors are \(\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b}\), \(\mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c}\), and \(\mathbf{c} + \mathbf{a}\), we start by writing down the matrix corresponding to these vectors:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m A = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a + b & b + c & c + a
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need to find the determinant of \(A\). The determinant of a \(3 \times 3\) matrix \(\begin{pmatrix} c_{11} & c_{12} & c_{13} \\ c_{21} & c_{22} & c_{23} \\ c_{31} & c_{32} & c_{33} \end{pmatrix}\) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det(A) = c_{11} \det\begin{pmatrix} c_{22} & c_{23} \\ c_{32} & c_{33} \end{pmatrix} - c_{12} \det\begin{pmatrix} c_{21} & c_{23} \\ c_{31} & c_{33} \end{pmatrix} + c_{13} \det\begin{pmatrix} c_{21} & c_{22} \\ c_{31} & c_{32} \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For our matrix, the determinant is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det(A) = (a + b) \det\begin{pmatrix} b + c & c + a \\ c + a & a + b \end{pmatrix} - (b + c) \det\begin{pmatrix} a + b & c + a \\ c + a & a + b \end{pmatrix} + (c + a) \det\begin{pmatrix} a + b & b + c \\ c + a & b + c \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can simplify the determinants inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det\begin{pmatrix} b + c & c + a \\ c + a & a + b \end{pmatrix} = (b + c)(a + b) - (c + a)^2 = ab + b^2 + ac + bc - (c^2 + 2ca + a^2) = ab + b^2 + ac + bc - c^2 - 2ca - a^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det\begin{pmatrix} a + b & c + a \\ c + a & a + b \end{pmatrix} = (a + b)(a + b) - (c + a)(c + a) = a^2 + 2ab + b^2 - (c^2 + 2ac + a^2) = 2ab - c^2 - 2ac - a^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det\begin{pmatrix} a + b & b + c \\ c + a & b + c \end{pmatrix} = (a + b)(b + c) - (b + c)(c + a) = ab + ac + b^2 + bc - (bc + ac + c^2 + a^2) = ab + ac + b^2 + bc - bc - ac - c^2 - a^2 = ab - a^2 - c^2 - a^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting these back into the determinant formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det(A) = (a + b)(ab + b^2 + ac + bc - c^2 - 2ca - a^2) - (b + c)(2ab - c^2 - 2ac - a^2) + (c + a)(ab - a^2 - c^2 - a^2)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Expanding each term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (a + b)(ab + b^2 + ac + bc - c^2 - 2ca - a^2) = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 + ab^2 + ac^3 + b^2c + abc^2 - ac^2 - ab^2 - bc^2 - bc^2 + abc + b^2c + b^2c - b^2c - c^3 = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 + 2ab^2 + 2abc^2 - ac^2 - ab^2 - bc^2 - 2abc^2 + abc = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (b + c)(2ab - c^2 - 2ac - a^2) = 2ab^2 - b^3 - 2abc - a^3 + 2b^2c - 2abc - a^2b = 2ab^2 - b^3 - 2abc - a^3 + 2b^2c - 2abc - a^2b = 2ab^2 - a^3 - b^3 - 2abc + 2b^2c - 2abc
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (c + a)(ab - a^2 - c^2 - a^2) = abc + ac^2 + b^2c + abc^2 - ac^2 - a^2c - ac^2 - b^2c - a^2a = abc + ac^2 + b^2c + abc^2 - a^2c - a^2c - ab^2 - a^3 = abc + ac^2 + b^2c - a^2c - b^2c - a^2c - ab^2 - a^3 = abc + b^2c - a^2c - ab^2 - a^2c - ab^2 - a^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Combining all these terms, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det(A) = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 2ab^2 - a^3 - b^3 - 2abc + 2b^2c - 2abc - 2abc + b^2c - a^2c - b^2c - a^2c - ab^2 - a^3 = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 2ab^2 - 2abc - 2abc - 2abc + b^2c - a^2c - b^2c - a^2c - b^2c - a^2c - ab^2 - a^3 = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 6ab^2 - 4abc + b^2c - 4abc
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplifying further:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \det(A) = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 6ab^2 - 4abc + b^2c - 4abc = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 10ab^2 - 8abc + b^2c - 4abc = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 16abc + b^2c = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 16abc + b^2c = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 16abc + b^2c = a^2b + ab^2 + ac^2 + b^3 - 16abc + b^2c
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, we see that the determinant of the matrix whose column vectors are \(\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b}\), \(\mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c}\), and \(\mathbf{c} + \mathbf{a}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
