[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's consider the first case:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ J - F = 27 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substitute \( F \) from the earlier expression:
