[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine how many more digits the base-10 number 87 has when expressed in base 2 than when expressed in base 3, we need to convert both numbers to their respective base-10 forms and then compare the results.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Step 1: Convert 87 from base-10 to base-2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To convert 87 from base-10 to base-2, we repeatedly divide 87 by 2 and记录 the remainders.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{r|l}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 87 \div 2 & 43 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 43 \div 2 & 21 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 21 \div 2 & 10 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 10 \div 2 & 5 \quad \text{remainder } 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5 \div 2 & 2 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 \div 2 & 1 \quad \text{remainder } 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 \div 2 & 0 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[87_{10} = 101111_{2}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the base-2 representation of 87 is \(\boxed{101111}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Step 2: Convert 87 from base-10 to base-3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To convert 87 from base-10 to base-3, we repeatedly divide 87 by 3 and record the remainders.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{array}{r|l}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 87 \div 3 & 28 \quad \text{remainder } 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 28 \div 3 & 9 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 9 \div 3 & 3 \quad \text{remainder } 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3 \div 3 & 1 \quad \text{remainder } 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1 \div 3 & 0 \quad \text{remainder } 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
