[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, multiply the numerators:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2 \times 3 \times 4 \times 5 = 120\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, multiply the denominators:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[3 \times 4 \times 5 \times 6 = 360\]
