[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(c^2 = a^2 - b^2\) in an ellipse only when \(c\) is the distance from the center to each focus, and \(c\) is between 0 and \(a\), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
