[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The distance between the foci is \(2c = 2 \times 2.5 = 5\) units.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the distance between the foci is \(\boxed{5}\).<|endoftext|>
