[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of ways to draw 3 balls out of 5:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The total number of ways to choose 3 balls out of 5 is given by the combination formula \( \binom{5}{3} \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \binom{5}{3} = \frac{5!}{3!(5-3)!} = \frac{5!}{3!2!} = \frac{5 \times 4}{2 \times 1} = 10
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, there are 10 possible ways to draw 3 balls out of 5.
