[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In the figure below, the largest circle has a radius of six meters. Five congruent smaller circles are placed as shown and are lined up in east-to-west and north-to-south orientations. What is the radius in meters of one of the five smaller circles?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
