[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the sum of the coefficients in the polynomial \(3(3x^7 + 8x^4 - 7) + 7(x^5 - 7x^2 + 5)\) when it is fully simplified, we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Distribute the constants inside the parentheses:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3(3x^7 + 8x^4 - 7) = 9x^7 + 24x^4 - 21
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    7(x^5 - 7x^2 + 5) = 7x^5 - 49x^2 + 35
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Combine the distributed terms:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    9x^7 + 24x^4 - 21 + 7x^5 - 49x^2 + 35
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Group the like terms together:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (9x^7 + 7x^5) + 24x^4 - 49x^2 - 21 + 35
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Simplify the coefficients:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    9x^7 + 7x^5 + 24x^4 - 49x^2 + 14
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Identify the sum of the coefficients by summing the coefficients of the polynomial:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    9 + 7 + 24 - 49 = 20
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the sum of the coefficients is \(\boxed{20}\).<|endoftext|>
