[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the sum of the odd integers from 11 to 39 is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
