[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To convert kilograms to pounds, we use the conversion factor \(1 \text{ kilogram} = 2.20 \text{ pounds}\). Therefore, to find out how many pounds \(x\) Alice should buy, we can use the following calculation:
