[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the sum of all single-digit replacements for \( z \) such that the number \( 24z38 \) is divisible by 6, we need to check the divisibility rules for 2 and 3. A number is divisible by 6 if and only if it is divisible by both 2 and 3. 
