[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{4 \cdot \sqrt{5} \cdot \sqrt{67}}{105} = \frac{4 \cdot \sqrt{5} \cdot \sqrt{67}}{105}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since 105 is \(3^2 \cdot 5\), we factor out the common terms in the numerator and simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
