[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The area of the quadrilateral \(ABCD\) is the area of the rectangle plus the area of one of the right triangles formed with \(AB\) and \(AD\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
