[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ (y - 1)(y - 3) = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Setting each factor equal to zero gives us the possible solutions for \( y \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ y - 1 = 0 \quad \text{or} \quad y - 3 = 0 \]
