[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ z = \pm \sqrt{3} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the solutions to the original equation \( z^4 - 4z^2 + 3 = 0 \) are:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ z = 1, -1, \sqrt{3}, -\sqrt{3} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
