[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can regroup the terms to complete the square:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[x^2 - 2x + y^2 - 4y = -1\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we complete the square for each variable:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[x^2 - 2x \quad \text{(take \(-2\) from both sides)}\]
