[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Similarly, for the \(y\) terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[y^2 - 4y \quad \text{(take \(-4\) from both sides)}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[y^2 - 4y + 4 - 4 \quad \text{(complete the square)}\]
