[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can use the Law of Cosines again to find \( AB \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m AB^2 = 10^2 + 6^2 - 2 \cdot 10 \cdot 6 \cdot \cos(\angle DAB)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The area of triangle \( AXY \) is then:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
