[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Understanding the Geometry**: We start by analyzing the figures. In Figure 1, there are two perpendicular sides that form a right-angled triangle. Four sides are removed, forming two right-angled triangles and a rectangle. The following figure shows the removed segments, assuming we are evaluating independently.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
