[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to find the coordinates of \(Q\), the intersection of line \(DN\) and line \(AC\). The equation of line \(AC\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ y = \frac{1}{2}(x - 2) \implies y = \frac{x - 2}{2}. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The equation of line \(DN\) is \(y = \frac{1}{3}x\). Setting these equal to each other:
