[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, we need to find the distance \(QA\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ QA = \sqrt{(0-6)^2 + (0-2)^2} = \sqrt{36 + 4} = \sqrt{40} = 2\sqrt{10}. \]
