[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we find the largest power of $b$ that is less than or equal to $423_{10}$. For $b = 9$, the largest power of $9$ is $81$ (since $81 \times 7 = 567$ and $81 \times 8 = 648$, which is less than $423$).
