[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute the determinant of the 2x2 matrix \(\begin{vmatrix} 0 & 1 \\ 3 & 5 \end{vmatrix}\), we use the formula for the determinant of a 2x2 matrix. The determinant of a matrix \(\begin{vmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{vmatrix}\) is given by \(ad - bc\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Here, the matrix is \(\begin{vmatrix} 0 & 1 \\ 3 & 5 \end{vmatrix}\). So, we identify the elements as follows:
