[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Finally, use Vieta's formulas again to find \( d \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \alpha^2\beta^2\gamma^2 = -1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
