[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We need to find the value of \((-27)^{5/3}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Recognize that the exponent \( \frac{5}{3} \) can be simplified as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \frac{5}{3} = 5 \times \frac{1}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (-27)^{5/3} = \left((-27)^{1} \times (-27)^{1/3}\right)^{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Calculate \((-27)^{1}\). Since raising a negative number to a power results in a negative number, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (-27)^{1} = -27
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Next, calculate \((-27)^{1/3}\). We need to find the cube root of \(-27\). The cube root of \(-27\) is \(-3\) because:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (-3) \times (-3) \times (-3) = -27
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Substitute these results back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (-27)^{5/3} = \left((-27)^{1} \times (-27)^{1/3}\right)^{5} = ( -27 \times -3)^5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. Simplify the expression inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (-27 \times -3)^5 = (81)^5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 6. Finally, calculate \((81)^5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (81)^5 = 81 \times 81 \times 81 \times 81 \times 81
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    81 \times 81 = 6561
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    6561 \times 81 = 531441
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    531441 \times 81 = 43144641
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (-27)^{5/3} = 43144641
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
