[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Simplify the cube root inside the cube root:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \sqrt[3]{2^{-6}} = 2^{-\frac{6}{3}} = 2^{-2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So the expression now is:
