[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( x \leq 60 \), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 60 - x + y = \frac{x}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Rearranging gives:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
