[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Area Calculation
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m After identifying the intersection points, we can calculate the area of the region. However, for simplicity, we can use the standard area formula for a closed region. The region is a square with side length 48 (since \( x \geq 60 \) and \( y \geq 0 \)).
