[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Compute
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[\sum_{n = 2}^{10000} \frac{1}{n \sqrt{n - 1} + (n - 1) \sqrt{n}}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute the sum \(\sum_{n = 2}^{10000} \frac{1}{n \sqrt{n - 1} + (n - 1) \sqrt{n}}\), we will start by examining the general term in the sum.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The term is \(\frac{1}{n \sqrt{n - 1} + (n - 1) \sqrt{n}}\). We can rationalize the denominator by multiplying the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1}{n \sqrt{n - 1} + (n - 1) \sqrt{n}} \cdot \frac{n \sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1) \sqrt{n}}{n \sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1) \sqrt{n}} = \frac{n \sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1) \sqrt{n}}{(n \sqrt{n - 1})^2 - ((n - 1) \sqrt{n})^2} = \frac{n \sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1) \sqrt{n}}{(n \sqrt{n - 1})^2 - (n - 1)^2 n}.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Expanding the denominators, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (n \sqrt{n - 1})^2 - (n - 1)^2 n = n^2 (n - 1) - (n - 1)^2 n = n^3 - n^2 - (n^2 - 2n + 1) n = n^3 - n^2 - n^3 + 2n^2 - n = n^2 - n = n(n - 1).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So the term becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{n \sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1) \sqrt{n}}{n(n - 1)} = \frac{\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1)}{n - 1} = \frac{(\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1)) \sqrt{n - 1} + ((n - 1) \sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1) \sqrt{n})}{n(n - 1)} = \frac{\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1)}{n(n - 1)} \left( \frac{\sqrt{n - 1}}{\sqrt{n - 1}} + \frac{(n - 1) \sqrt{n - 1}}{(n - 1) \sqrt{n - 1}} \right) = \frac{\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1)}{n(n - 1)} \cdot (1 + 1) = \frac{\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1)}{n(n - 1)} \cdot 2 = \frac{2(\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1))}{n(n - 1)}.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the sum is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sum_{n = 2}^{10000} \frac{2(\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1))}{n(n - 1)} = 2 \sum_{n = 2}^{10000} \left( \frac{\sqrt{n - 1} - (n - 1)}{n(n - 1)} \right) = 2 \sum_{n = 2}^{10000} \left( \frac{1}{n} - \frac{1}{n - 1} \right).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This is a telescoping series, where most terms cancel out:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 \left( \left( \frac{1}{2} - \frac{1}{1} \right) + \left( \frac{1}{3} - \frac{1}{2} \right) + \left( \frac{1}{4} - \frac{1}{3} \right) + \cdots + \left( \frac{1}{10000} - \frac{1}{10001} \right) \right).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The series simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 \left( 1 - \frac{1}{10001} \right) = 2 \left( \frac{10000}{10001} \right) = \frac{20000}{10001}.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{\frac{20000}{10001}}.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
