[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To evaluate \( f(6) - f(4) \) where \( f(x) = (x-1)(x-3)(x-7)(x-9) \), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Evaluate \( f(6) \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
