[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, \( f(6) = 45 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Evaluate \( f(4) \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
