[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3 \cdot (-3) = -9
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    (-9) \cdot (-5) = 45
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, \( f(4) = 45 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate \( f(6) - f(4) \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    f(6) - f(4) = 45 - 45 = 0
