[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 19. If \( A = -9 \) (but since we are dealing with digits, it doesn't make sense).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the above analysis, the possible values for \( A \) are \( 1, 3, 5, 7, 9 \). However, we need to check which of these values makes the digit \( A \) a valid digit (1, 2, 3, 4, 5).
