[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine the dimensions and thickness of the deck panels used to build the balcony, we need to consider the structure and the process involved. We will break down the problem into smaller parts:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Identify the Building Components:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The balcony is constructed from deck panels.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The deck panels form the structure of the balcony.
