[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Relevant Dimensions:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The deck panels are typically rectangular or square in shape.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The balcony will consist of a uniform width due to the design consideration that it is made from deck panels.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Width Calculation:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Let's assume each deck panel is 0.5 meters wide for simplicity.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - If the balcony is 2 steps high, the total height of the deck panels will be:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \text{Total height} = 2 \times 0.5 \text{ meters} = 1 \text{ meter}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Therefore, the embedded height (parallel to the floor) of the deck panels would be:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \text{Embedded height} = \text{Total height} - \text{Width} = 1 \text{ meter} - 0.5 \text{ meters} = 0.5 \text{ meters}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - So, the embedded height without considering the deck panels' thickness would be 0.5 meters.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Thickness Consideration:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The thickness of the deck panels can be considered as part of the overall thickness of the balcony.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Normally, the thickness of the deck panels would be allowed to vary due to construction needs.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. **Overall Thickness:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The overall thickness plus the embedded height should meet the structural requirements and the desired aesthetic design. For simplicity, let's assume we need to build the balcony in a way that it is safe and functional. A common thickness for deck panels is typically around 0.5 to 1 meter depending on the material used and the requirements of the structure.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, based on the above analysis, the dimensions and thickness of the deck panels used to build the balcony would be:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{\text{Width: 0.5 meters, Embedded height: 0.5 meters, Total thickness: 1 meter}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
