[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In the diagram, $D$ and $E$ are the midpoints of $\overline{AB}$ and $\overline{BC}$ respectively.  Determine the area of $\triangle DBC$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [asy]
