[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. The next step is to simplify the outermost expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{2^{-\frac{5}{3}}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(2^{-\frac{5}{3}}\) can be written as \(2^{-\frac{5}{3}}\), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{2^{-\frac{5}{3}}} = 2^{-\frac{5}{3} \cdot \frac{1}{2}} = 2^{-\frac{5}{6}}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
