[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute \(\arcsin \left( -\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \right)\), we need to find the angle \(\theta\) in radians such that \(\sin \theta = -\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\) and \(-\frac{\pi}{2} < \theta \leq \frac{\pi}{2}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
