[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the expression \(1 - 2 + 3 - 4 + \cdots + 2001 - 2002 + 2003 - 2004 + 2005 - 2006 + 2007\), we can pair the terms in a way that makes the calculations simpler. Notice that some terms cancel out perfectly:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[1 - 2 + 3 - 4 + 5 - 6 + \cdots + 2005 - 2006 + 2007\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
