[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[1 - 2 + 3 - 4 + 5 - 6 + \cdots + 2005 - 2006 + 2007 = (1 - 2) + (3 - 4) + \cdots + (2005 - 2006) + 2007 = -1 + -1 + \cdots + -1 + 2007,\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m where there are 2007 pairs of \(-1\) plus the term 2007.
