[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Of course! Let's denote the lengths of the sides of rectangle \(A_3\) as \(x\) and \(y\). Since the area of rectangle \(A_3\) is given by the product of its length and width, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
