[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Triangle $ABC$ is an isosceles triangle with $AB=BC$. Point $D$ is the midpoint of both $\overline{BC}$ and $\overline{AE}$, and $\overline{CE}$ is 11 units long. What is the length of $\overline{BD}$?  Express your answer as a decimal to the nearest tenth.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [asy]
