[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, group the terms involving \( y \) and the constant term:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (8xy - 12y) + 2x - 3 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Factor out \( y \) from the terms involving \( y \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
