[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For this equation to hold for all values of \( y \), the coefficients of \( y \) and the constant term must separately equal zero. Therefore, we set up the following system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
