[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Divide both sides by 8:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
