[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m ### Verifying the second equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
