[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Since the complex number \(-324 + 243i\) is in the second quadrant, we need to add \(\pi\) to the general argument:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \arg(z) = \pi + \tan^{-1}\left(-\frac{3}{4}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the magnitude and argument of the complex number \(-324 + 243i\) are:
