[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the given problem, we start with the equation \(\mathbf{A} \mathbf{B} = \mathbf{B} \mathbf{A}\). Both \(\mathbf{A}\) and \(\mathbf{B}\) are square matrices, so they commute. This implies that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
