[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Multiplying through by \(d\) to clear the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 15d = 7ad + 220
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Rearranging terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
