[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Factoring out \(d\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m d(7a - 15) = 220
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(c = 15\), we have \(a \neq 15\). Let's try some values for \(d\) and solve for \(a\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m If \(d = 4\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 7a - 15 = 4
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 7a = 19
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m a = \frac{19}{7}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to find \(\frac{a - d}{c - 3b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m c - 3b = 15 - 3 \left( \frac{22}{7} \right) = 15 - \frac{66}{7} = \frac{105}{7} - \frac{66}{7} = \frac{39}{7}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{a - d}{c - 3b} = \frac{\frac{19}{7}}{\frac{39}{7}} = \frac{19}{39}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
