[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[a \nabla b = \frac{a + b}{1 + ab}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[a = 2\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[b = 5\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We substitute these values into the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2 \nabla 5 = \frac{2 + 5}{1 + 2 \times 5}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, calculate the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
