[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, put these results back into the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2 \nabla 5 = \frac{7}{11}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
