[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    x^3 - 6x^2 - 9x + 30
