[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Repeat the process**: Now, divide the leading term of the new polynomial \(x^3\) by the leading term of the divisor \(x\), which gives \(x^2\). Write \(x^2\) again above the division bar.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
