[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Find the value of $(52+6\sqrt{43})^{3/2}-(52-6\sqrt{43})^{3/2}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the value of \((52 + 6\sqrt{43})^{3/2} - (52 - 6\sqrt{43})^{3/2}\), we will use the property of exponents that states \((a + b)^n = a^n + b^n + 2ab(a + b) + (2n-1)ab(a + b)^{n-1}\) and \((a - b)^n = a^n - b^n + 2ab(a - b) + (2n-1)ab(a - b)^{n-1}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's rewrite the expression \((52 + 6\sqrt{43})^{3/2} - (52 - 6\sqrt{43})^{3/2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (52 + 6\sqrt{43})^{3/2} - (52 - 6\sqrt{43})^{3/2} = \left((52 + 6\sqrt{43}) - (52 - 6\sqrt{43})\right)^{3/2}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
