[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m But we need to find \(\alpha\) such that \(\tan \alpha = x\). The angle \(\alpha\) that satisfies this is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
