[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Identify the amount of sugar in each carton: 5 kilograms.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Multiply the number of cartons by the amount of sugar in each carton:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    50 \text{ cartons} \times 5 \text{ kilograms/carton} = 250 \text{ kilograms}
