[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Club A has a required reserves of $5000 and assessed funding of $6000. Club B has no required reserves and assesses $9000. Club C has no required reserves and assesses $4500. If Club D has required reserves of $7000 and assesses $7000, how much more did Club B owe in assessments than Club A and Club D combined?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's break down the problem step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
