[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Claudia has 100 tokens in her possession. Each token is divided into two halves. From the first half she took 50 tokens. She subsequently divided the remaining halves into four equal stacks each containing 20 tokens. How many tokens did Claudia incorporate into the stacks to achieve this?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine how many tokens Claudia incorporated into the stacks, we start by analyzing the steps she took and the number of tokens involved at each stage.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Initial Tokens:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Claudia starts with 100 tokens.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Tokens Taken:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Claudia takes 50 tokens from the first half of the tokens.
