[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Since the number of stacks must be an integer, we need to check if the problem allows for a fractional token. However, the problem specifies that each resturant can only be divided into whole stacks, so we assume this interpretation is possible for practical purposes (i.e., a repeated division).
