[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, \(\binom{40}{8} = 2951021604200\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Adding these two results together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
