[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify the expression \(\left( \frac{1}{2k} \right)^{-2} \cdot (-k)^3\), we will break it down into smaller steps.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, simplify the term \(\left( \frac{1}{2k} \right)^{-2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left( \frac{1}{2k} \right)^{-2} = \left( 2k \right)^2 = 4k^2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the expression now becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4k^2 \cdot (-k)^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, simplify \((-k)^3\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m (-k)^3 = -k^3
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the expression now is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4k^2 \cdot (-k^3)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, perform the multiplication:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4k^2 \cdot (-k^3) = 4 \cdot (-1) \cdot k^2 \cdot k^3 = -4k^5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the simplified form of the expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{-4k^5}
