[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine how many feet Javier travels in one minute at a speed of 15 miles per hour, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Convert Javier's speed from miles per hour to feet per minute:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - There are 5280 feet in a mile.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - There are 60 minutes in an hour.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
