[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ q(t) = \frac{\pi t \ln(\sqrt{2ct} + c)}{2t} = \frac{\pi}{2t} \ln(\sqrt{2ct} + c) = F(t) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the general solution for \(F(t)\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ F(t) = \frac{\pi c}{2\pi t} \ln(\sqrt{2ct} + c) + C \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
