[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ \frac{\pi c}{2} \ln(1 + c) + C = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ \frac{\pi c}{2} \ln\left(\frac{\sqrt{2c} + c}{1 + c}\right) + C = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Evaluating at \(t = 1\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ F(1) = \frac{\pi c}{2} \ln(\sqrt{2c} + c) + C = 0 \]
