[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To simplify the expression \(90r - 44r\), we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Identify the like terms in the expression. In this case, \(90r\) and \(-44r\) are like terms because they both contain the variable \(r\).
