[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - Rounding up the tenths place from \(4\) to \(5\) gives us \(5\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. **Combine the rounded numbers:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    - The value \(3.45\) rounded to the nearest tenth is \(3.5\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
