[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[339 + 169 = 508,\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[508 + 688 = 1296,\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m so
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[1296 + 175 = 1471.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the denominator simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[1471.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we can rewrite the original expression with the simplified numerator and denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[\dfrac{2780}{1471}.\]
