[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Rounding 142.7142857 up gives us 143. Therefore, the smallest integer multiple of 7 that is a three-digit number is 143. We can check this by multiplying 143 by 7:
