[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to determine which of the given statements are true:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m A. \( x \) is a multiple of 4.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m B. \( x \) is a multiple of 8.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m C. \( x \) is a multiple of 16.
