[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Evaluate $\left\lceil\sqrt{27}\right\rceil - \left\lfloor\sqrt{26}\right\rfloor$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To evaluate the expression \(\left\lceil\sqrt{27}\right\rceil - \left\lfloor\sqrt{26}\right\rfloor\), we need to determine the numerical values of \(\left\lceil\sqrt{27}\right\rceil\) and \(\left\lfloor\sqrt{26}\right\rfloor\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we find \(\sqrt{27}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{27} = \sqrt{9 \times 3} = 3\sqrt{3} \approx 5.196
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The ceiling of \(3\sqrt{3}\) is 6 because 3\sqrt{3} is approximately 5.196, and the smallest integer greater than or equal to 5.196 is 6.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left\lceil\sqrt{27}\right\rceil = 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we find \(\sqrt{26}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sqrt{26} \approx 5.109
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The floor of \(5.109\) is 5 because 5.109 is slightly less than 6, and the largest integer less than or equal to 5.109 is 5.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left\lfloor\sqrt{26}\right\rfloor = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now we substitute these values back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left\lceil\sqrt{27}\right\rceil - \left\lfloor\sqrt{26}\right\rfloor = 6 - 5 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{1}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
