[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let $A,$ $B,$ $C$ be the angles of a triangle.  Evaluate
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} \sin^2 A & \cot A & 1 \\ \sin^2 B & \cot B & 1 \\ \sin^2 C & \cot C & 1 \end{vmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To evaluate the determinant of the given \(3 \times 3\) matrix, we start with the matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{vmatrix} \sin^2 A & \cot A & 1 \\ \sin^2 B & \cot B & 1 \\ \sin^2 C & \cot C & 1 \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can use properties of determinants and trigonometric identities to simplify this expression. Let's denote the determinant by \(D\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m D = \sin^2 A \begin{vmatrix} \cot B & 1 \\ \cot C & 1 \end{vmatrix} - \cot A \begin{vmatrix} \sin^2 B & 1 \\ \sin^2 C & 1 \end{vmatrix} + 1 \begin{vmatrix} \sin^2 B & \cot B \\ \sin^2 C & \cot C \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we compute the 2x2 determinants:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{vmatrix} \cot B & 1 \\ \cot C & 1 \end{vmatrix} = \cot B \cdot 1 - 1 \cdot \cot C = \cot B - \cot C
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{vmatrix} \sin^2 B & 1 \\ \sin^2 C & 1 \end{vmatrix} = \sin^2 B \cdot 1 - 1 \cdot \sin^2 C = \sin^2 B - \sin^2 C
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \begin{vmatrix} \sin^2 B & \cot B \\ \sin^2 C & \cot C \end{vmatrix} = \sin^2 B \cdot \cot C - \cot B \cdot \sin^2 C
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(\cot x = \frac{\cos x}{\sin x}\), we can rewrite the above determinants in terms of sine and cosine:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \cot B - \cot C = \frac{\cos B}{\sin B} - \frac{\cos C}{\sin C} = \frac{\cos B \sin C - \cos C \sin B}{\sin^2 B \sin C} = \frac{\cos (B - C)}{\sin^2 B \sin C}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sin^2 B - \sin^2 C = \frac{\sin^2 B - \sin^2 C}{\sin^2 B \sin C} = \frac{\sin (B - C)}{\sin^2 B \sin C}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \sin^2 B \cot C - \cot B \sin^2 C = \sin^2 B \cdot \frac{\cos C}{\sin C} - \cot B \sin^2 C = \sin B \cos C - \frac{\cos B \sin^2 C}{\sin C} = \sin B \cos C - \cos B \sin B = \sin (B - C)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Substituting these back into the original determinant expression, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m D = \sin^2 A \left( \frac{\cos B \sin C - \cos C \sin B}{\sin^2 B \sin C} \right) - \cot A \left( \frac{\sin^2 B \cos C - \cos B \sin B}{\sin^2 B \sin C} \right) + \left( \frac{\sin B \cos C - \cos B \sin B}{\sin^2 B \sin C} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m D = \frac{\sin^2 A (\cos B \sin C - \cos C \sin B) - \cot A (\sin^2 B \cos C - \cos B \sin B) + \sin B \cos C - \cos B \sin B}{\sin^2 B \sin C}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m D = \frac{\sin^2 A \cos B \sin C - \sin^3 A \cos C - \cot A \sin^2 B \cos C + \cos A \sin B \cos B + \sin B \cos C - \cos B \sin B}{\sin^2 B \sin C}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \(\cot A = \frac{\cos A}{\sin A}\) and \(\cot B = \frac{\cos B}{\sin B}\) and \(\cot C = \frac{\cos C}{\sin C}\), we can further simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m D = \frac{\sin^2 A \cos B \sin C - \sin^3 A \cos C - \frac{\cos A}{\sin A} \sin^2 B \cos C + \cos A \sin B \cos B + \sin B \cos C - \cos B \sin B}{\sin^2 B \sin C}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
