[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3 is not a perfect square.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. For \( n = 3 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    S = \frac{3(3+1)}{2} = \frac{3 \cdot 4}{2} = 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    6 is not a perfect square.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. For \( n = 4 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    S = \frac{4(4+1)}{2} = \frac{4 \cdot 5}{2} = 10
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    10 is not a perfect square.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 5. For \( n = 5 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
