[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    21 is not a perfect square.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 7. For \( n = 7 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
