[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The last digit of 25 is 5, which is odd, not even.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 7. **Calculate the next perfect square after 25:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The next perfect square after 25 is 49 (since \( 25^2 = 625 \)).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 8. **Verify the last digit of 49:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The last digit of 49 is 9, which is odd, not even.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 9. **Calculate the next perfect square after 49:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The next perfect square after 49 is 200 (since \( 49^2 = 2401 \)).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 10. **Verify the last digit of 200:**
