[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In the diagram, $\triangle XYZ$ is right-angled at $X,$ with $YX=60$ and $XZ=80.$ The point $W$ is on $YZ$ so that $WX$ is perpendicular to $YZ.$ Determine the length of $WZ.$ [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m pair X, Y, Z, W;
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Y=(0,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m X=(36,48);
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Z=(100,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m W=(36,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m draw(X--Y--Z--X--W);
