[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To determine how many years it will take for the tree to grow from 12 feet to 36 feet, we start by converting inch growth into feet. Since there are 12 inches in a foot, we divide 36 feet by 12 inches per foot:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
