[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the value of $\frac{5!\cdot2!}{3!}$
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the expression \(\frac{5! \cdot 2!}{3!}\), we will break it down step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we need to evaluate the factorials:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. \(5!\) (5 factorial) is the product of all positive integers up to 5.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    5! = 5 \times 4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1 = 120
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. \(2!\) (2 factorial) is the product of all positive integers up to 2.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2! = 2 \times 1 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. \(3!\) (3 factorial) is the product of all positive integers up to 3.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    3! = 3 \times 2 \times 1 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we substitute these values into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{5! \cdot 2!}{3!} = \frac{120 \cdot 2}{6}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we perform the multiplication in the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 120 \cdot 2 = 240
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Then, we divide by the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{240}{6} = 40
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression is \(\boxed{40}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 40
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
