[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Calculate the total sum of the original 10 numbers:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The average of the 10 numbers is given as 85. Therefore, the total sum of these numbers can be calculated as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Total sum} = 85 \times 10 = 850
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Determine the total sum of the remaining 8 numbers after removing 70 and 76:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    If we subtract the values 70 and 76 from the original total sum, we get the sum of the remaining 8 numbers:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
