[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. **Calculate the average of the remaining 8 numbers:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The average of these 8 numbers is the total sum of the remaining numbers divided by 8:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Average of remaining numbers} = \frac{724}{8} = 90.5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the average of the remaining numbers is \(\boxed{90.5}\).<|endoftext|>
