[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[a_3 = 3^0 + 3^1 + 3^2 + 3^3 = 1 + 3 + 9 + 27 = 40,\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[a_4 = 3^0 + 3^1 + 3^2 + 3^3 + 3^4 = 1 + 3 + 9 + 27 + 81 = 121.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
