[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Determine Eugene's running speed:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Eugene runs at a rate of 4 miles per hour.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Determine Brianna's running speed:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    Brianna runs \(\frac{2}{3}\) as fast as Eugene. Therefore, Brianna's running speed is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Brianna's speed} = \frac{2}{3} \times 4 = \frac{8}{3} \text{ miles per hour}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
