[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the speed at which Katie runs is \(\boxed{\frac{56}{15}}\) miles per hour.<|endoftext|>
