[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m If $992\,466\,1A6$ is divisible by $8,$ where $A$ represents one digit, what is the sum of the possible values of $A?$
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
