[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the sum of the digits of the base $7$ representation of $777_{10}$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To convert the decimal number \(777_{10}\) to its base 7 representation, we can repeatedly divide the number by 7 and keep track of the remainders. Here are the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. Divide 777 by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    777 \div 7 = 111 \text{ remainder } 0
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the least significant digit (rightmost) is 0.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. Divide 111 by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    111 \div 7 = 15 \text{ remainder } 6
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the next digit is 6.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. Divide 15 by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    15 \div 7 = 2 \text{ remainder } 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the next digit is 1.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 4. Divide 2 by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2 \div 7 = 0 \text{ remainder } 2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    So, the last digit is 2.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we have the base 7 representation: \(2160_7\). To find the total sum of the digits, we add these digits together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2 + 1 + 6 + 0 = 9
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the sum of the digits of the base 7 representation of \(777_{10}\) is \(\boxed{9}\).<|endoftext|>
