[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For the \(y\) terms, we take half of \(-16\) (the coefficient of \(y\)), square it, and substitute it back into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
