[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2y^2 - 16y + 64 = 5(5 - x) + 64
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m For the left side, we complete the square:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2(y^2 - 8y + 16) = 5(5 - x) + 64
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
