[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since there are two foci, we can choose either one. Let's choose \(h = 3\) and \(c = \sqrt{\frac{123 - 5(3)}{2}} = \sqrt{\frac{123 - 15}{2}} = \sqrt{\frac{108}{2}} = \sqrt{54} = 3\sqrt{6}\). The coordinates of the foci are:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left(3 \pm 3\sqrt{6}, 4\right)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the coordinates of the foci are:
