[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the multiplicative inverse of 450 modulo 3599, we need to find an integer \( x \) such that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 450x \equiv 1 \pmod{3599} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This means we need to find \( x \) such that:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 450x - 3599k = 1 \]
