[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we solve the system of equations from the two planes:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2bx + cy = 0
