[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m When three positive integers are divided by $47$, the remainders are $25$, $20$, and $3$, respectively.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m When the sum of the three integers is divided by $47$, what is the remainder?
