[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's try \(n = 3\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2(3)^2 + 8(3) + 4 = 2 \cdot 9 + 24 + 4 = 18 + 24 + 4 = 46 \neq 60
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Let's try \(n = 4\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2(4)^2 + 8(4) + 4 = 2 \cdot 16 + 32 + 4 = 32 + 32 + 4 = 68 \neq 60
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, let's try \(n = 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2(5)^2 + 8(5) + 4 = 2 \cdot 25 + 40 + 4 = 50 + 40 + 4 = 94 \neq 60
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The correct solution is:
