[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m n = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m The two consecutive positive even numbers are \(10\) and \(14\). The sum of the original two numbers is:
