[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve the expression \(101^3 - 3 \cdot 101^2 + 3 \cdot 101 - 1\), we can recognize that it is a binomial expansion. This expression can be written as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
