[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We can break this down step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 100 \times 100 = 10000
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 10000 \times 100 = 1000000
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So, the value of \(101^3 - 3 \cdot 101^2 + 3 \cdot 101 - 1\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
