[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \text{Katie's speed} = \frac{8}{3} \times \frac{7}{5} = \frac{56}{15} \text{ miles per hour}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, Katie runs at a speed of \(\boxed{\frac{56}{15}}\) miles per hour.<|endoftext|>
