[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ T_4 = T_3 + 1010 = 4242 + 1010 = 5252 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ T_5 = T_4 + 1010 = 5252 + 1010 = 6262 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ T_6 = T_5 + 1010 = 6262 + 1010 = 7272 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ T_7 = T_6 + 1010 = 7272 + 1010 = 8282 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we need to find the sum of the sixth and seventh terms. So, we calculate:
