[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 29^2 = 841 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we substitute these values back into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 900 - 841 = x \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Perform the subtraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 900 - 841 = 59 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Thus, the number Emily subtracted from \( 30^2 \) to get \( 29^2 \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
