[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - Envelope D: Length = 11 inches, Height = 4 inches
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   \frac{11}{4} = 2.75 \quad \text{(less than 1.3)}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we compare each envelope's length divided by its height to the thresholds:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - Envelope A: \(\frac{6}{4} = 1.5 > 1.3\)
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m - Envelope B: \(\frac{9}{3} = 3.0 > 2.5\)
