[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m From the calculations, we see that all four envelopes have a length divided by its height that exceeds 1.3 or 2.5. Therefore, all four envelopes must pay the extra \$0.11 in postage.
