[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    8! - 6! = 40320 - 720 = 39600
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the number of ways to arrange the books such that there is at least one math book on both ends is \(\boxed{39600}\).<|endoftext|>
