[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the projection of \(-2 \mathbf{v}\) onto \(\mathbf{w}\), we start by using the formula for the projection of a vector \(\mathbf{v}\) onto a vector \(\mathbf{w}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} \mathbf{v} = \frac{\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w}}{\mathbf{w} \cdot \mathbf{w}} \mathbf{w}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Given that \(\operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} \mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix}\), we can identify the following for \(\mathbf{v}\) and \(\mathbf{w}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{v} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \mathbf{w} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix} = 1 \cdot 1 + 0 \cdot 0 + (-3) \cdot (-3) = 1 + 9 = 10
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} \mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we need to find \(\operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} (-2 \mathbf{v})\). Using the same projection formula, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} (-2 \mathbf{v}) = \frac{(-2 \mathbf{v}) \cdot \mathbf{w}}{\mathbf{w} \cdot \mathbf{w}} \mathbf{w}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m We know that \(\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w} = 1\) and \(\mathbf{w} \cdot \mathbf{w} = 10\). Therefore, the magnitude of the projection is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \left| \operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} (-2 \mathbf{v}) \right| = \frac{(-2 \mathbf{v}) \cdot \mathbf{w}}{10} = \frac{-2 (\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w})}{10} = \frac{-2 \cdot 1}{10} = \frac{-2}{10} = \frac{-1}{5}
