[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 14 - 5.5 = 8.5 \text{ dollars} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This means the stuffed animal cost $5.5, but since the problem asks for the cost of the stuffed animal and we need to solve for it directly from the total cost:
