[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In this case, \(a = 101\) and \(b = 1\), so the expression \(101^3 - 3 \cdot 101^2 + 3 \cdot 101 - 1\) can be rewritten as:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
