[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m In rectangle $ADEH$, points $B$ and  $C$  trisect $\overline{AD}$, and points $G$ and  $F$ trisect $\overline{HE}$. In addition,  $AH=AC=2$. What is the area of  quadrilateral $WXYZ$ shown in the figure?
