[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m What is the remainder when $2000+2001+2002+2003+2004+2005+2006$ is divided by $7$?
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To find the remainder when \(2000 + 2001 + 2002 + 2003 + 2004 + 2005 + 2006\) is divided by 7, we will break the problem into smaller parts by considering each number modulo 7 separately and then combine the results.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, let's find the remainder when each number from 2000 to 2006 is divided by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2000 \div 7 = 285 \text{ remainder } 5 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2000 \equiv 5 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2001 \div 7 = 285 \text{ remainder } 1 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2001 \equiv 1 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2002 \div 7 = 285 \text{ remainder } 2 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2002 \equiv 2 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2003 \div 7 = 285 \text{ remainder } 3 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2003 \equiv 3 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2004 \div 7 = 285 \text{ remainder } 4 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2004 \equiv 4 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2005 \div 7 = 285 \text{ remainder } 5 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2005 \equiv 5 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[2006 \div 7 = 285 \text{ remainder } 6 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 2006 \equiv 6 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we add these remainders together:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[5 + 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 = 26\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Finally, we find the remainder when 26 is divided by 7:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[26 \div 7 = 3 \text{ remainder } 5 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 26 \equiv 5 \pmod{7}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the remainder when \(2000 + 2001 + 2002 + 2003 + 2004 + 2005 + 2006\) is divided by 7 is \(\boxed{5}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
