[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Compute $\dbinom{10}{2}\times \dbinom{8}{3}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To compute \(\binom{10}{2} \times \binom{8}{3}\), we will use the definition of combinations. The binomial coefficient \(\binom{n}{k}\) is given by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \binom{n}{k} = \frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m First, we compute \(\binom{10}{2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \binom{10}{2} = \frac{10!}{2!(10-2)!} = \frac{10!}{2! \cdot 8!} = \frac{10 \times 9 \times 8!}{2 \times 1 \times 8!} = \frac{10 \times 9}{2 \times 1} = 45
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we compute \(\binom{8}{3}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \binom{8}{3} = \frac{8!}{3!(8-3)!} = \frac{8!}{3! \cdot 5!} = \frac{8 \times 7 \times 6 \times 5!}{3 \times 2 \times 1 \times 5!} = \frac{8 \times 7 \times 6}{3 \times 2 \times 1} = \frac{336}{6} = 56
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Now, we multiply the results of \(\binom{10}{2}\) and \(\binom{8}{3}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \binom{10}{2} \times \binom{8}{3} = 45 \times 56 = 2520
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \boxed{2520}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
