[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since \( k \) must be a one-digit number (as it represents a year), the only possible value for \( k \) is 10. Therefore, the first year after 2000 for which the sum of the digits is 12 is:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2000 + 10 = 2010
