[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[3 \cdot 7^1 = 3 \cdot 7 = 21\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[5 \cdot 7^0 = 5 \cdot 1 = 5\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Next, we sum these values:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[49 + 21 + 5 = 75\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Therefore, the base 10 equivalent of \(135_7\) is \(\boxed{75}\).<|endoftext|>
