[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m To solve this problem, we need to find the points where the curve \( y = \sin x \) intersects a horizontal line at \( y = \sin 70^\circ \).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Find the intersection points:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
