[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[ 53 + 55 + 57 + 59 = 254 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Since 254 is not divisible by 3, we try the next prime number, which is 59. The sequence becomes \( 59, 61, 63, 65 \), and their sum is:
