[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m This is a telescoping product, where most terms in the numerator and the denominator will cancel out. Let's write it out explicitly:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{1 \cdot 2 \cdot 3 \cdot 4 \cdots 49 \cdot 50}{4 \cdot 5 \cdot 6 \cdot 7 \cdots 52 \cdot 53}
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
