[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    The units digit is 9 for \(n \equiv 2 \pmod{4}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 3. For \(n \equiv 3 \pmod{4}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[ 3^{2k+3} = 81 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[ 3^{2k+4} = 729 \]
