[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[x = 2001^{1002} - \frac{1}{2001^{1002}} = 2001^{1002} - \frac{1}{(2001 + 1)(2001 - 1)} = 2001^{1002} - \frac{1}{2002 \cdot 2000} = 2001^{1002} - \frac{1}{2002^2 \cdot 2} = 2001^{1002} - \frac{1}{2 \cdot 1001^2}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m So,
