[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 1. **Calculate the sum of the given numbers:**
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    2000 + 2001 + 2002 + 2003 + 2004 + 2005 + 2006
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m 2. **Sum the numbers:**
