[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{9 + 3y}{90} \cdot 3 = -2
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m Simplifying these equations, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \frac{9 + 3y}{10} = -6 \implies 9 + 3y = -60 \implies 3y = -69 \implies y = -23
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1419827)[0m \[
